      "cml:operator": "<=",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Temporal interval for the use or disclosure of genetic information",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The use or disclosure of genetic information is permitted if it occurs within a certain time frame.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The use or disclosure of genetic information must occur before a certain date."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-1-sec-16b-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "16B(5) Permitted health situations in relation to the collection, use or",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-1-sec-16b-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.24",
      "values:originalText": "(5) A permitted health situation exists in relation to the disclosure by\nan organisation of health information about an individual if:\n\n(a) the organisation provides a health service to the individual;\nand\n\n(b) the recipient of the information is a responsible person for the\nindividual; and\n\n(c) the individual:\n\n(i) is physically or legally incapable of giving consent to\nthe disclosure; or\n\n(ii) physically cannot communicate consent to the\ndisclosure; and\n\n(d) another individual (the carer) providing the health service for\nthe organisation is satisfied that either:\n\n(i) the disclosure is necessary to provide appropriate care\nor treatment of the individual; or\n\n(ii) the disclosure is made for compassionate reasons; and\n\n(e) the disclosure is not contrary to any wish:\n\n(i) expressed by the individual before the individual\nbecame unable to give or communicate consent; and\n\n(ii) of which the carer is aware, or of which the carer could\nreasonably be expected to be aware; and\n\n(f) the disclosure is limited to the extent reasonable and\nnecessary for a purpose mentioned in paragraph (d).",
      "skos:definition": "(5) A permitted health situation exists in relation to the disclosure by\nan organisation of health information about an individual if:\n\n(a) the organisation provides a health service to the individual;\nand\n\n(b) the recipient of the information is a responsible person for the\nindividual; and\n\n(c) the individual:\n\n(i) is physically or legally incapable of giving consent to\nthe disclosure; or\n\n(ii) physically cannot communicate consent to the\ndisclosure; and\n\n(d) another individual (the carer) providing the health service for\nthe organisation is satisfied that either:\n\n(i) the disclosure is necessary to provide appropriate care\nor treatment of the individual; or\n\n(ii) the disclosure is made for compassionate reasons; and\n\n(e) the disclosure is not contrary to any wish:\n\n(i) expressed by the individual before the individual\nbecame unable to give or communicate consent; and\n\n(ii) of which the carer is aware, or of which the carer could\nreasonably be expected to be aware; and\n\n(f) the disclosure is limited to the extent reasonable and\nnecessary for a purpose mentioned in paragraph (d).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-1-sec-16b"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-1-sec-16b-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-1-sec-16b-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-1-sec-16b-ss-5-logic-deontic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-1-sec-16b-ss-5-logic-deontic-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-1-sec-16b-ss-5-logic-deontic-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a3bd88b6f6779f1e201d5fb4fa77bf2b632f20dae45dd049025a38911dcf0247",
      "skos:note": "Permitted health situations for disclosure of health information"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-1-sec-16b-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "16B(5) Permitted health situations in relation to the collection, use or",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 24,
      "values:originalText": "(5) A permitted health situation exists in relation to the disclosure by\nan organisation of health information about an individual if:\n\n(a) the organisation provides a health service to the individual;\nand\n\n(b) the recipient of the information is a responsible person for the\nindividual; and\n\n(c) the individual:\n\n(i) is physically or legally incapable of giving consent to\nthe disclosure; or\n\n(ii) physically cannot communicate consent to the\ndisclosure; and\n\n(d) another individual (the carer) providing the health service for\nthe organisation is satisfied that either:\n\n(i) the disclosure is necessary to provide appropriate care\nor treatment of the individual; or\n\n(ii) the disclosure is made for compassionate reasons; and\n\n(e) the disclosure is not contrary to any wish:\n\n(i) expressed by the individual before the individual\nbecame unable to give or communicate consent; and\n\n(ii) of which the carer is aware, or of which the carer could\nreasonably be expected to be aware; and\n\n(f) the disclosure is limited to the extent reasonable and\nnecessary for a purpose mentioned in paragraph (d)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-1-sec-16b-ss-5-norm",
      "@type": "values:Permission",
