      "cml:premiseText": "Subsection (2) does not apply to the making of regulations for the purposes of Australian Privacy Principle 9.3 that relate to...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "the identifier is a kind commonly used in the processing of pay, or deductions from pay, of Commonwealth officers, or a class of Commonwealth officers;"
    },
    {
