      "values:originalText": "1 The object of this principle is to ensure that APP entities manage\npersonal information in an open and transparent way.\nCompliance with the Australian Privacy Principles etc."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-1-sec-1-3-norm",
