      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.33",
      "values:originalText": "6 If a person or body requests a copy of the APP privacy policy of an\nAPP entity in a particular form, the entity must take such steps as\nare reasonable in the circumstances to give the person or body a\ncopy in that form.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nSchedule 1  Australian Privacy Principles\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\n\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15",
      "skos:definition": "6 If a person or body requests a copy of the APP privacy policy of an\nAPP entity in a particular form, the entity must take such steps as\nare reasonable in the circumstances to give the person or body a\ncopy in that form.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nSchedule 1  Australian Privacy Principles\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\n\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-1-sec-1-8-norm"
        },
        {
