    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-1-sec-7-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "7 6 If an organisation (the first organisation) uses or discloses",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-1-sec-7-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.42",
      "values:originalText": "personal information about an individual:\n\n(a) for the purpose of direct marketing by the first organisation;\nor\n\n(b) for the purpose of facilitating direct marketing by other\norganisations;\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nAustralian Privacy Principles  Schedule 1\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\nthe individual may:\n\n(c) if paragraph (a) applies—request not to receive direct\nmarketing communications from the first organisation; and\n\n(d) if paragraph (b) applies—request the organisation not to use\nor disclose the information for the purpose referred to in that\nparagraph; and\n\n(e) request the first organisation to provide its source of the\ninformation.",
      "skos:definition": "personal information about an individual:\n\n(a) for the purpose of direct marketing by the first organisation;\nor\n\n(b) for the purpose of facilitating direct marketing by other\norganisations;\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nAustralian Privacy Principles  Schedule 1\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\nthe individual may:\n\n(c) if paragraph (a) applies—request not to receive direct\nmarketing communications from the first organisation; and\n\n(d) if paragraph (b) applies—request the organisation not to use\nor disclose the information for the purpose referred to in that\nparagraph; and\n\n(e) request the first organisation to provide its source of the\ninformation.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-1-sec-7-8-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-1-sec-7-8-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f38c26767110140929aaa2400ed63999acc93c0fd357d6f2b66f932eb753acc2",
      "skos:note": "Individuals have right to request not to receive direct marketing communications or for their information to be used/disclosed."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-1-sec-7-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "7 6 If an organisation (the first organisation) uses or discloses",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 42,
      "values:originalText": "personal information about an individual:\n\n(a) for the purpose of direct marketing by the first organisation;\nor\n\n(b) for the purpose of facilitating direct marketing by other\norganisations;\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nAustralian Privacy Principles  Schedule 1\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\nthe individual may:\n\n(c) if paragraph (a) applies—request not to receive direct\nmarketing communications from the first organisation; and\n\n(d) if paragraph (b) applies—request the organisation not to use\nor disclose the information for the purpose referred to in that\nparagraph; and\n\n(e) request the first organisation to provide its source of the\ninformation."
    },
    {
