      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.43",
      "values:originalText": "organisation must not charge the individual for the making of, or to\ngive effect to, the request and:\n\n(a) if the request is of a kind referred to in paragraph 7.6(c) or\n(d)—the first organisation must give effect to the request\nwithin a reasonable period after the request is made; and\n\n(b) if the request is of a kind referred to in paragraph 7.6(e)—the\norganisation must, within a reasonable period after the\nrequest is made, notify the individual of its source unless it is\nimpracticable or unreasonable to do so.\nInteraction with other legislation",
      "skos:definition": "organisation must not charge the individual for the making of, or to\ngive effect to, the request and:\n\n(a) if the request is of a kind referred to in paragraph 7.6(c) or\n(d)—the first organisation must give effect to the request\nwithin a reasonable period after the request is made; and\n\n(b) if the request is of a kind referred to in paragraph 7.6(e)—the\norganisation must, within a reasonable period after the\nrequest is made, notify the individual of its source unless it is\nimpracticable or unreasonable to do so.\nInteraction with other legislation",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-1-sec-7-9-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-1-sec-7-9-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-1-sec-7-9-logic-deontic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1d07004dadf488fb87d9e6c74ccefa3baebb254d7a5f83765b2f4f5527f402b1",
      "skos:note": "Organisation must not charge individual for request making and give effect to request within reasonable period."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-1-sec-7-9",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "7 7 If an individual makes a request under subclause 7.6, the first",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 43,
      "values:originalText": "organisation must not charge the individual for the making of, or to\ngive effect to, the request and:\n\n(a) if the request is of a kind referred to in paragraph 7.6(c) or\n(d)—the first organisation must give effect to the request\nwithin a reasonable period after the request is made; and\n\n(b) if the request is of a kind referred to in paragraph 7.6(e)—the\norganisation must, within a reasonable period after the\nrequest is made, notify the individual of its source unless it is\nimpracticable or unreasonable to do so.\nInteraction with other legislation"
    },
