      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.45",
      "values:originalText": "an individual as its own identifier of the individual unless:\n\n(a) the adoption of the government related identifier is required\nor authorised by or under an Australian law or a\ncourt/tribunal order; or\n\n(b) subclause 9.3 applies in relation to the adoption.\nNote:\nAn act or practice of an agency may be treated as an act or practice of\nan organisation, see section 7A.\nUse or disclosure of government related identifiers",
      "skos:definition": "an individual as its own identifier of the individual unless:\n\n(a) the adoption of the government related identifier is required\nor authorised by or under an Australian law or a\ncourt/tribunal order; or\n\n(b) subclause 9.3 applies in relation to the adoption.\nNote:\nAn act or practice of an agency may be treated as an act or practice of\nan organisation, see section 7A.\nUse or disclosure of government related identifiers",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-1-sec-9-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-1-sec-9-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "36e824e5c4abf84aa8be6dcd1a713ee7701948eeae4f302b8a1975c45ca41b9f",
      "skos:note": "An organisation must not adopt a government related identifier of an individual as its own identifier."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-1-sec-9-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "9 1 An organisation must not adopt a government related identifier of",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 45,
      "values:originalText": "an individual as its own identifier of the individual unless:\n\n(a) the adoption of the government related identifier is required\nor authorised by or under an Australian law or a\ncourt/tribunal order; or\n\n(b) subclause 9.3 applies in relation to the adoption.\nNote:\nAn act or practice of an agency may be treated as an act or practice of\nan organisation, see section 7A.\nUse or disclosure of government related identifiers"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-1-sec-9-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-1-sec-9-3"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
