      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.49",
      "values:originalText": "(a) to give access to the personal information because of\nsubclause 12.2 or 12.3; or\n\n(b) to give access in the manner requested by the individual;\nthe entity must take such steps (if any) as are reasonable in the\ncircumstances to give access in a way that meets the needs of the\nentity and the individual.",
      "skos:definition": "(a) to give access to the personal information because of\nsubclause 12.2 or 12.3; or\n\n(b) to give access in the manner requested by the individual;\nthe entity must take such steps (if any) as are reasonable in the\ncircumstances to give access in a way that meets the needs of the\nentity and the individual.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-1-sec-12-7-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-1-sec-12-7-logic-deontic-1"
