      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.51",
      "values:originalText": "requested by the individual, the entity must give the individual a\nwritten notice that sets out:\n\n(a) the reasons for the refusal except to the extent that it would\nbe unreasonable to do so; and\n\n(b) the mechanisms available to complain about the refusal; and\n\n(c) any other matter prescribed by the regulations.\nRequest to associate a statement",
      "skos:definition": "requested by the individual, the entity must give the individual a\nwritten notice that sets out:\n\n(a) the reasons for the refusal except to the extent that it would\nbe unreasonable to do so; and\n\n(b) the mechanisms available to complain about the refusal; and\n\n(c) any other matter prescribed by the regulations.\nRequest to associate a statement",
      "cml:asserts": [
