    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-1-sec-13-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "13 Section 13",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-1-sec-13-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.51",
      "values:originalText": "5 If a request is made under subclause 13.1 or 13.4, the APP entity:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nSchedule 1  Australian Privacy Principles\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\n\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n(a) must respond to the request:\n\n(i) if the entity is an agency—within 30 days after the\nrequest is made; or\n\n(ii) if the entity is an organisation—within a reasonable\nperiod after the request is made; and\n\n(b) must not charge the individual for the making of the request,\nfor correcting the personal information or for associating the\nstatement with the personal information (as the case may be).\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nCredit reporting  Schedule 2\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15",
      "skos:definition": "5 If a request is made under subclause 13.1 or 13.4, the APP entity:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nSchedule 1  Australian Privacy Principles\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\n\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n(a) must respond to the request:\n\n(i) if the entity is an agency—within 30 days after the\nrequest is made; or\n\n(ii) if the entity is an organisation—within a reasonable\nperiod after the request is made; and\n\n(b) must not charge the individual for the making of the request,\nfor correcting the personal information or for associating the\nstatement with the personal information (as the case may be).\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nCredit reporting  Schedule 2\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-1-sec-13-7-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-1-sec-13-7-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e354bd6802b2f95d17cb5524cce578074283e03ae36e9e7ca7b412750fe2704e",
      "skos:note": "Must respond to request within specified timeframe and not charge individual for making the request.",
      "dc:description": "Response to request"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-1-sec-13-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "13 Section 13",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 51,
      "values:originalText": "5 If a request is made under subclause 13.1 or 13.4, the APP entity:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nSchedule 1  Australian Privacy Principles\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\n\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n(a) must respond to the request:\n\n(i) if the entity is an agency—within 30 days after the\nrequest is made; or\n\n(ii) if the entity is an organisation—within a reasonable\nperiod after the request is made; and\n\n(b) must not charge the individual for the making of the request,\nfor correcting the personal information or for associating the\nstatement with the personal information (as the case may be).\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nCredit reporting  Schedule 2\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15"
    },
