    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-13",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "13 Subsection 6(1)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-13"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.55",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nSchedule 2  Credit reporting\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\n\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\nCP derived information about an individual means any personal\ninformation (other than sensitive information) about the individual:\n\n(a) that is derived from credit reporting information about the\nindividual that was disclosed to a credit provider by a credit\nreporting body under Division 2 of Part IIIA; and\n\n(b) that has any bearing on the individual’s credit worthiness;\nand\n\n(c) that is used, has been used or could be used in establishing\nthe individual’s eligibility for consumer credit.",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nSchedule 2  Credit reporting\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\n\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\nCP derived information about an individual means any personal\ninformation (other than sensitive information) about the individual:\n\n(a) that is derived from credit reporting information about the\nindividual that was disclosed to a credit provider by a credit\nreporting body under Division 2 of Part IIIA; and\n\n(b) that has any bearing on the individual’s credit worthiness;\nand\n\n(c) that is used, has been used or could be used in establishing\nthe individual’s eligibility for consumer credit.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-13-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-13-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-13-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-13-logic-alleninterval-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "077fbcbb23aa3b1ac3e986b352ada31f6491399a5470882f79dfa5979016aec4",
      "skos:note": "Definition of CP derived information about an individual"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-13",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "13 Subsection 6(1)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 55,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nSchedule 2  Credit reporting\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\n\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\nCP derived information about an individual means any personal\ninformation (other than sensitive information) about the individual:\n\n(a) that is derived from credit reporting information about the\nindividual that was disclosed to a credit provider by a credit\nreporting body under Division 2 of Part IIIA; and\n\n(b) that has any bearing on the individual’s credit worthiness;\nand\n\n(c) that is used, has been used or could be used in establishing\nthe individual’s eligibility for consumer credit."
    },
