        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.61",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\npending correction request in relation to credit information or\nCRB derived information means:\n\n(a) a request made under subsection 20T(1) in relation to the\ninformation if a notice has not been given under subsection\n20U(2) or (3) in relation to the request; or\n\n(b) a request made under subsection 21V(1) in relation to the\ninformation if:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nSchedule 2  Credit reporting\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\n\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n(i) the credit reporting body referred to in subsection\n20V(3) has been consulted about the request under\nsubsection 21V(3); and\n\n(ii) a notice has not been given under subsection 21W(2) or\n(3) in relation to the request.",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\npending correction request in relation to credit information or\nCRB derived information means:\n\n(a) a request made under subsection 20T(1) in relation to the\ninformation if a notice has not been given under subsection\n20U(2) or (3) in relation to the request; or\n\n(b) a request made under subsection 21V(1) in relation to the\ninformation if:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nSchedule 2  Credit reporting\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\n\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n(i) the credit reporting body referred to in subsection\n20V(3) has been consulted about the request under\nsubsection 21V(3); and\n\n(ii) a notice has not been given under subsection 21W(2) or\n(3) in relation to the request.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-47-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-47-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-47-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "bdccc309a00c5755afe2bdf2a8f88e40a064a09d6394ca70a44473e2f84315c0",
      "skos:note": "Request for credit information or CRB derived information must be made to a credit reporting body and not given notice under subsection 21W(2) or (3)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-47",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "47 Subsection 6(1)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 61,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\npending correction request in relation to credit information or\nCRB derived information means:\n\n(a) a request made under subsection 20T(1) in relation to the\ninformation if a notice has not been given under subsection\n20U(2) or (3) in relation to the request; or\n\n(b) a request made under subsection 21V(1) in relation to the\ninformation if:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nSchedule 2  Credit reporting\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\n\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n(i) the credit reporting body referred to in subsection\n20V(3) has been consulted about the request under\nsubsection 21V(3); and\n\n(ii) a notice has not been given under subsection 21W(2) or\n(3) in relation to the request."
    },
