    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-6g-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6G(5) Meaning of credit provider",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-6g-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.66",
      "values:originalText": "(5) Despite subsections (1) to (4) of this section, an organisation or\nsmall business operator acting in the capacity of:\n\n(a) a real estate agent; or\n\n(b) a general insurer (within the meaning of the Insurance Act\n1973); or\n\n(c) an employer of an individual;\nis not a credit provider while acting in that capacity.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) Despite subsections (1) to (4) of this section, an organisation or\nsmall business operator acting in the capacity of:\n\n(a) a real estate agent; or\n\n(b) a general insurer (within the meaning of the Insurance Act\n1973); or\n\n(c) an employer of an individual;\nis not a credit provider while acting in that capacity.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-6g"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-6g-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-6g-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b5094758c0de6acea347eae58ec63da87ea3d003dfaeab5cd53a004691a116d8",
      "skos:note": "An organisation or small business operator is not a credit provider while acting in certain capacities."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-6g-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6G(5) Meaning of credit provider",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 66,
      "values:originalText": "(5) Despite subsections (1) to (4) of this section, an organisation or\nsmall business operator acting in the capacity of:\n\n(a) a real estate agent; or\n\n(b) a general insurer (within the meaning of the Insurance Act\n1973); or\n\n(c) an employer of an individual;\nis not a credit provider while acting in that capacity."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-6g-ss-5-norm",
