      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.70",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If subsection (1) of this section applies in relation to credit for\nwhich an application has been made to the original credit provider,\nthe application is taken, for the purposes of this Act, to have been\nmade to the acquirer.\nSubdivision B—Other definitions",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If subsection (1) of this section applies in relation to credit for\nwhich an application has been made to the original credit provider,\nthe application is taken, for the purposes of this Act, to have been\nmade to the acquirer.\nSubdivision B—Other definitions",
      "values:partOf": {
