    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-6l",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6L Meaning of access seeker",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-6l"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.70",
      "values:originalText": "(1) An access seeker in relation to credit reporting information, or\ncredit eligibility information, about an individual is:\n\n(a) the individual; or\n\n(b) a person:\n\n(i) who is assisting the individual to deal with a credit\nreporting body or credit provider; and\n\n(ii) who is authorised, in writing, by the individual to make\na request in relation to the information under subsection\n20R(1) or 21T(1).\n\n(2) An individual must not authorise a person under\nsubparagraph (1)(b)(ii) if the person is:\n\n(a) a credit provider; or\n\n(b) a mortgage insurer; or\n\n(c) a trade insurer; or\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nCredit reporting  Schedule 2\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n(d) a person who is prevented from being a credit provider by\nsubsection 6G(5) or (6).\n\n(3) Subparagraph (1)(b)(ii) does not apply to a person who provides\nthe National Relay Service or a person prescribed by the\nregulations.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) An access seeker in relation to credit reporting information, or\ncredit eligibility information, about an individual is:\n\n(a) the individual; or\n\n(b) a person:\n\n(i) who is assisting the individual to deal with a credit\nreporting body or credit provider; and\n\n(ii) who is authorised, in writing, by the individual to make\na request in relation to the information under subsection\n20R(1) or 21T(1).\n\n(2) An individual must not authorise a person under\nsubparagraph (1)(b)(ii) if the person is:\n\n(a) a credit provider; or\n\n(b) a mortgage insurer; or\n\n(c) a trade insurer; or\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nCredit reporting  Schedule 2\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n(d) a person who is prevented from being a credit provider by\nsubsection 6G(5) or (6).\n\n(3) Subparagraph (1)(b)(ii) does not apply to a person who provides\nthe National Relay Service or a person prescribed by the\nregulations.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-6l-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-6l-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-6l-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f177004dcda3400a087376806831db761e0cc051c7ca4f269aa52ec5ebd89e23"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-6l",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6L Meaning of access seeker",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 70,
      "values:originalText": "(1) An access seeker in relation to credit reporting information, or\ncredit eligibility information, about an individual is:\n\n(a) the individual; or\n\n(b) a person:\n\n(i) who is assisting the individual to deal with a credit\nreporting body or credit provider; and\n\n(ii) who is authorised, in writing, by the individual to make\na request in relation to the information under subsection\n20R(1) or 21T(1).\n\n(2) An individual must not authorise a person under\nsubparagraph (1)(b)(ii) if the person is:\n\n(a) a credit provider; or\n\n(b) a mortgage insurer; or\n\n(c) a trade insurer; or\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nCredit reporting  Schedule 2\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n(d) a person who is prevented from being a credit provider by\nsubsection 6G(5) or (6).\n\n(3) Subparagraph (1)(b)(ii) does not apply to a person who provides\nthe National Relay Service or a person prescribed by the\nregulations."
    },
