      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.70",
      "values:originalText": "(2) An individual must not authorise a person under\nsubparagraph (1)(b)(ii) if the person is:\n\n(a) a credit provider; or\n\n(b) a mortgage insurer; or\n\n(c) a trade insurer; or\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nCredit reporting  Schedule 2\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n(d) a person who is prevented from being a credit provider by\nsubsection 6G(5) or (6).",
      "skos:definition": "(2) An individual must not authorise a person under\nsubparagraph (1)(b)(ii) if the person is:\n\n(a) a credit provider; or\n\n(b) a mortgage insurer; or\n\n(c) a trade insurer; or\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nCredit reporting  Schedule 2\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n(d) a person who is prevented from being a credit provider by\nsubsection 6G(5) or (6).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-6l"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
