      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.71",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Without limiting subsection (1), credit includes:\n\n(a) a hire-purchase agreement; and\n\n(b) a contract, arrangement or understanding of a kind referred to\nin that subsection that is for the hire, lease or rental of goods,\nor for the supply of services, other than a contract,\narrangement or understanding under which:\n\n(i) full payment is made before, or at the same time as, the\ngoods or services are provided; and\n\n(ii) in the case of goods—an amount greater than, or equal\nto, the value of the goods is paid as a deposit for the\nreturn of the goods.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Without limiting subsection (1), credit includes:\n\n(a) a hire-purchase agreement; and\n\n(b) a contract, arrangement or understanding of a kind referred to\nin that subsection that is for the hire, lease or rental of goods,\nor for the supply of services, other than a contract,\narrangement or understanding under which:\n\n(i) full payment is made before, or at the same time as, the\ngoods or services are provided; and\n\n(ii) in the case of goods—an amount greater than, or equal\nto, the value of the goods is paid as a deposit for the\nreturn of the goods.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-6m"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-6m-ss-3-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7ab4ea4328a90ea03d81934e69a1971bc8b4fb641b6a9bb90079429a731478dd",
      "skos:note": "Defines credit and its components"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-6m-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6M(3) Meaning of credit and amount of credit",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 71,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Without limiting subsection (1), credit includes:\n\n(a) a hire-purchase agreement; and\n\n(b) a contract, arrangement or understanding of a kind referred to\nin that subsection that is for the hire, lease or rental of goods,\nor for the supply of services, other than a contract,\narrangement or understanding under which:\n\n(i) full payment is made before, or at the same time as, the\ngoods or services are provided; and\n\n(ii) in the case of goods—an amount greater than, or equal\nto, the value of the goods is paid as a deposit for the\nreturn of the goods."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-6m-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
