      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.72",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Despite subsection (1), a business or undertaking is not a credit\nreporting business if the business or undertaking is included in a\nclass of businesses or undertakings prescribed by the regulations.",
