      },
      "cml:conclusionText": "Default information about an individual is required to be provided by a credit provider."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-6r",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6R Meaning of information request",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-6r"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.74",
      "values:originalText": "Credit provider\n\n(1)  A credit provider has made an information request in relation to\nan individual if the provider has sought information about the\nindividual from a credit reporting body:\n\n(a) in connection with an application for consumer credit made\nby the individual to the provider; or\n\n(b) in connection with an application for commercial credit made\nby a person to the provider; or\n\n(c) for a credit guarantee purpose of the provider in relation to\nthe individual; or\n\n(d) for a securitisation related purpose of the provider in relation\nto the individual.\nMortgage insurer\n\n(2) A mortgage insurer has made an information request in relation to\nan individual if:\n\n(a) the insurer has sought information about the individual from\na credit reporting body; and\n\n(b) the information was sought in connection with the provision\nof insurance to a credit provider in relation to mortgage credit\nprovided by the provider to:\n\n(i) the individual; or\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nCredit reporting  Schedule 2\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n(ii) a person for whom the individual is, or is proposing to\nbe, a guarantor.\nTrade insurer\n\n(3) A trade insurer has made an information request in relation to an\nindividual if:\n\n(a) the insurer has sought information about the individual from\na credit reporting body; and\n\n(b) the information was sought in connection with the provision\nof insurance to a credit provider in relation to commercial\ncredit provided by the provider to the individual or another\nperson.",
      "skos:definition": "Credit provider\n\n(1)  A credit provider has made an information request in relation to\nan individual if the provider has sought information about the\nindividual from a credit reporting body:\n\n(a) in connection with an application for consumer credit made\nby the individual to the provider; or\n\n(b) in connection with an application for commercial credit made\nby a person to the provider; or\n\n(c) for a credit guarantee purpose of the provider in relation to\nthe individual; or\n\n(d) for a securitisation related purpose of the provider in relation\nto the individual.\nMortgage insurer\n\n(2) A mortgage insurer has made an information request in relation to\nan individual if:\n\n(a) the insurer has sought information about the individual from\na credit reporting body; and\n\n(b) the information was sought in connection with the provision\nof insurance to a credit provider in relation to mortgage credit\nprovided by the provider to:\n\n(i) the individual; or\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nCredit reporting  Schedule 2\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n(ii) a person for whom the individual is, or is proposing to\nbe, a guarantor.\nTrade insurer\n\n(3) A trade insurer has made an information request in relation to an\nindividual if:\n\n(a) the insurer has sought information about the individual from\na credit reporting body; and\n\n(b) the information was sought in connection with the provision\nof insurance to a credit provider in relation to commercial\ncredit provided by the provider to the individual or another\nperson.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-6r-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-6r-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-6r-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "bd6a91e95822702158794a4c94aa67878459b9d464905c8ec1b261af4a0c60b2"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-6r",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6R Meaning of information request",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 74,
      "values:originalText": "Credit provider\n\n(1)  A credit provider has made an information request in relation to\nan individual if the provider has sought information about the\nindividual from a credit reporting body:\n\n(a) in connection with an application for consumer credit made\nby the individual to the provider; or\n\n(b) in connection with an application for commercial credit made\nby a person to the provider; or\n\n(c) for a credit guarantee purpose of the provider in relation to\nthe individual; or\n\n(d) for a securitisation related purpose of the provider in relation\nto the individual.\nMortgage insurer\n\n(2) A mortgage insurer has made an information request in relation to\nan individual if:\n\n(a) the insurer has sought information about the individual from\na credit reporting body; and\n\n(b) the information was sought in connection with the provision\nof insurance to a credit provider in relation to mortgage credit\nprovided by the provider to:\n\n(i) the individual; or\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nCredit reporting  Schedule 2\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n(ii) a person for whom the individual is, or is proposing to\nbe, a guarantor.\nTrade insurer\n\n(3) A trade insurer has made an information request in relation to an\nindividual if:\n\n(a) the insurer has sought information about the individual from\na credit reporting body; and\n\n(b) the information was sought in connection with the provision\nof insurance to a credit provider in relation to commercial\ncredit provided by the provider to the individual or another\nperson."
    },
