    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-20c-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "20C(6) Collection of solicited credit information",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-20c-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.81",
      "values:originalText": "(6) Despite paragraph (4)(b), consumer credit liability information\nabout the individual may relate to consumer credit that was entered\ninto on a day before the individual turned 18, so long as the\nconsumer credit was not terminated, or did not otherwise cease to\nbe in force, on a day before the individual turned 18.\nMeans of collection",
      "skos:definition": "(6) Despite paragraph (4)(b), consumer credit liability information\nabout the individual may relate to consumer credit that was entered\ninto on a day before the individual turned 18, so long as the\nconsumer credit was not terminated, or did not otherwise cease to\nbe in force, on a day before the individual turned 18.\nMeans of collection",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-20c"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-20c-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-20c-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-20c-ss-6-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0093242806f29bd685e958d4e944f753ba0b963d3bba54af3f9135e30b899f4f",
      "skos:note": "Consumer credit liability information can relate to credit entered before turning 18."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-20c-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "20C(6) Collection of solicited credit information",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 81,
      "values:originalText": "(6) Despite paragraph (4)(b), consumer credit liability information\nabout the individual may relate to consumer credit that was entered\ninto on a day before the individual turned 18, so long as the\nconsumer credit was not terminated, or did not otherwise cease to\nbe in force, on a day before the individual turned 18.\nMeans of collection"
    },
