      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.84",
      "values:originalText": "(5) If a credit reporting body discloses credit reporting information\nunder this section, the body must make a written note of that\ndisclosure.\nCivil penalty:\n500 penalty units.\nNote:\nOther Acts may provide that the note must not be made (see for\nexample the Australian Crime Commission Act 2002 and the Law\nEnforcement Integrity Commissioner Act 2006).\nNo use or disclosure for the purposes of direct marketing",
      "skos:definition": "(5) If a credit reporting body discloses credit reporting information\nunder this section, the body must make a written note of that\ndisclosure.\nCivil penalty:\n500 penalty units.\nNote:\nOther Acts may provide that the note must not be made (see for\nexample the Australian Crime Commission Act 2002 and the Law\nEnforcement Integrity Commissioner Act 2006).\nNo use or disclosure for the purposes of direct marketing",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-20e"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
