      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.87",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If a credit reporting body holds credit reporting information about\nan individual, the body must not use or disclose the information for\nthe purposes of direct marketing.\nCivil penalty:\n2,000 penalty units.\nPermitted use for pre-screening",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If a credit reporting body holds credit reporting information about\nan individual, the body must not use or disclose the information for\nthe purposes of direct marketing.\nCivil penalty:\n2,000 penalty units.\nPermitted use for pre-screening",
      "values:partOf": {
