      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.87",
      "values:originalText": "(3) In assessing under paragraph (2)(d) whether or not the individual is\neligible to receive the direct marketing communications of the\ncredit provider, the credit reporting body must have regard to the\neligibility requirements nominated by the provider.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) In assessing under paragraph (2)(d) whether or not the individual is\neligible to receive the direct marketing communications of the\ncredit provider, the credit reporting body must have regard to the\neligibility requirements nominated by the provider.",
      "values:partOf": {
