      "skos:prefLabel": "20M(4) Use or disclosure of credit reporting information that is",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-20m-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.92",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Without limiting subsection (3), the rules may relate to the\nfollowing matters:\n\n(a) the kinds of de-identified information that may or may not be\nused or disclosed for the purposes of conducting the research;\n\n(b) whether or not the research is research in relation to credit;\n\n(c) the purposes of conducting the research;\n\n(d) consultation about the research;\n\n(e) how the research is conducted.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nCredit reporting  Schedule 2\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\nSubdivision E—Integrity of credit reporting information",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Without limiting subsection (3), the rules may relate to the\nfollowing matters:\n\n(a) the kinds of de-identified information that may or may not be\nused or disclosed for the purposes of conducting the research;\n\n(b) whether or not the research is research in relation to credit;\n\n(c) the purposes of conducting the research;\n\n(d) consultation about the research;\n\n(e) how the research is conducted.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nCredit reporting  Schedule 2\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\nSubdivision E—Integrity of credit reporting information",
      "values:partOf": {
