    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-20p",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "20P False or misleading credit reporting information",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-20p"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.93",
      "values:originalText": "Offence\n\n(1) A credit reporting body commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the body uses or discloses credit reporting information under\nthis Division (other than subsections 20D(2) and 20T(4));\nand\n\n(b) the information is false or misleading in a material particular.\nPenalty: 200 penalty units.\nCivil penalty\n\n(2) A credit reporting body must not use or disclose credit reporting\ninformation under this Division (other than subsections 20D(2) and\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nSchedule 2  Credit reporting\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\n\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n20T(4)) if the information is false or misleading in a material\nparticular.\nCivil penalty:\n2,000 penalty units.",
      "skos:definition": "Offence\n\n(1) A credit reporting body commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the body uses or discloses credit reporting information under\nthis Division (other than subsections 20D(2) and 20T(4));\nand\n\n(b) the information is false or misleading in a material particular.\nPenalty: 200 penalty units.\nCivil penalty\n\n(2) A credit reporting body must not use or disclose credit reporting\ninformation under this Division (other than subsections 20D(2) and\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nSchedule 2  Credit reporting\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\n\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n20T(4)) if the information is false or misleading in a material\nparticular.\nCivil penalty:\n2,000 penalty units.",
