    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-20x-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "20X(2) Retention period for credit information—personal insolvency",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-20x-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.102",
      "values:originalText": "(2) If personal insolvency information relates to a debt agreement\nproposal, the retention period for the information is the period that\nends on the day on which:\n\n(a) the proposal is withdrawn; or\n\n(b) the proposal is not accepted under section 185EC of the\nBankruptcy Act; or\n\n(c) the acceptance of the proposal for processing is cancelled\nunder section 185ED of that Act; or\n\n(d) the proposal lapses under section 185G of that Act.\nControl of property",
      "skos:definition": "(2) If personal insolvency information relates to a debt agreement\nproposal, the retention period for the information is the period that\nends on the day on which:\n\n(a) the proposal is withdrawn; or\n\n(b) the proposal is not accepted under section 185EC of the\nBankruptcy Act; or\n\n(c) the acceptance of the proposal for processing is cancelled\nunder section 185ED of that Act; or\n\n(d) the proposal lapses under section 185G of that Act.\nControl of property",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-20x"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-20x-ss-2-norm"
        }
      ],
