      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.102",
      "values:originalText": "(5) An expression used in this section that is also used in the\nBankruptcy Act has the same meaning in this section as it has in\nthat Act.",
