      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.105",
      "values:originalText": "(4) However, the credit reporting body may use or disclose the\ninformation under this subsection if:\n\n(a) the use or disclosure is for the purposes of the pending\ncorrection request, or pending dispute, in relation to the\ninformation; or\n\n(b) the use or disclosure of the information is required by or\nunder an Australian law or a court/tribunal order.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) However, the credit reporting body may use or disclose the\ninformation under this subsection if:\n\n(a) the use or disclosure is for the purposes of the pending\ncorrection request, or pending dispute, in relation to the\ninformation; or\n\n(b) the use or disclosure of the information is required by or\nunder an Australian law or a court/tribunal order.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-20z"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
