      "values:originalText": "(5) If the credit reporting body uses or discloses the information under\nsubsection (4), the body must make a written note of the use or\ndisclosure.\nCivil penalty:\n500 penalty units.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nSchedule 2  Credit reporting\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\n\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\nDirection to destroy information etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) If the credit reporting body uses or discloses the information under\nsubsection (4), the body must make a written note of the use or\ndisclosure.\nCivil penalty:\n500 penalty units.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nSchedule 2  Credit reporting\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\n\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\nDirection to destroy information etc.",
