      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.106",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If the credit reporting body uses or discloses the information under\nsubsection (3), the body must make a written note of the use or\ndisclosure.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nCredit reporting  Schedule 2\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\nCivil penalty:\n500 penalty units.\nOther requirements",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If the credit reporting body uses or discloses the information under\nsubsection (3), the body must make a written note of the use or\ndisclosure.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nCredit reporting  Schedule 2\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\nCivil penalty:\n500 penalty units.\nOther requirements",
      "values:partOf": {
