    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21d-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "21D(5) Disclosure of credit information to a credit reporting body",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-21d-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.111",
      "values:originalText": "(5) Despite paragraph (3)(a), consumer credit liability information\nabout the individual may relate to consumer credit that was entered\ninto on a day before the individual turned 18, so long as the\nconsumer credit was not terminated, or did not otherwise cease to\nbe in force, on a day before the individual turned 18.\nWritten note of disclosure",
      "skos:definition": "(5) Despite paragraph (3)(a), consumer credit liability information\nabout the individual may relate to consumer credit that was entered\ninto on a day before the individual turned 18, so long as the\nconsumer credit was not terminated, or did not otherwise cease to\nbe in force, on a day before the individual turned 18.\nWritten note of disclosure",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21d"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21d-ss-5-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "001971e1b2cfd1b8ae42270bd50e9d38cdbf816524df6c89b4fa5b12c8200cbd",
      "skos:note": "Consumer credit liability information about the individual may relate to consumer credit entered into before the individual turned 18."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-21d-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "21D(5) Disclosure of credit information to a credit reporting body",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 111,
      "values:originalText": "(5) Despite paragraph (3)(a), consumer credit liability information\nabout the individual may relate to consumer credit that was entered\ninto on a day before the individual turned 18, so long as the\nconsumer credit was not terminated, or did not otherwise cease to\nbe in force, on a day before the individual turned 18.\nWritten note of disclosure"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21d-ss-5-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21d-ss-5"
