      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.114",
      "values:originalText": "(6) If a credit provider uses or discloses credit eligibility information\nunder this section, the provider must make a written note of that\nuse or disclosure.\nCivil penalty:\n500 penalty units.\nInteraction with the Australian Privacy Principles",
      "skos:definition": "(6) If a credit provider uses or discloses credit eligibility information\nunder this section, the provider must make a written note of that\nuse or disclosure.\nCivil penalty:\n500 penalty units.\nInteraction with the Australian Privacy Principles",
