      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.118",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The consent of the individual under paragraph (1)(d) must be given\nin writing unless:\n\n(a) if subparagraph (1)(a)(i) applies—the application for the\ncredit was not made in writing; or\n\n(b) if subparagraph (1)(a)(ii) applies—the application for the\ncredit has not been made in writing.\nGuarantors etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The consent of the individual under paragraph (1)(d) must be given\nin writing unless:\n\n(a) if subparagraph (1)(a)(i) applies—the application for the\ncredit was not made in writing; or\n\n(b) if subparagraph (1)(a)(ii) applies—the application for the\ncredit has not been made in writing.\nGuarantors etc.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21j"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
