    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21n-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "21N(2) Permitted CP disclosures to other recipients",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-21n-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.122",
      "values:originalText": "(2) A disclosure by a credit provider of credit eligibility information\nabout an individual is a permitted CP disclosure in relation to the\nindividual if:\n\n(a) the disclosure is to one or more of the following (the\nrecipient):\n\n(i) an entity;\n\n(ii) a professional legal adviser of the entity;\n\n(iii) a professional financial adviser of the entity; and\n\n(b) the recipient has an Australian link; and\n\n(c) subsection (3) applies to the information.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) A disclosure by a credit provider of credit eligibility information\nabout an individual is a permitted CP disclosure in relation to the\nindividual if:\n\n(a) the disclosure is to one or more of the following (the\nrecipient):\n\n(i) an entity;\n\n(ii) a professional legal adviser of the entity;\n\n(iii) a professional financial adviser of the entity; and\n\n(b) the recipient has an Australian link; and\n\n(c) subsection (3) applies to the information.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21n"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21n-ss-2-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "cc5e45e6e36c7b96f2db6935732cd9ac92337f2f00ae03b3e5f18224a752fe3d",
      "skos:note": "Permitted CP disclosures to other recipients"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-21n-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "21N(2) Permitted CP disclosures to other recipients",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 122,
      "values:originalText": "(2) A disclosure by a credit provider of credit eligibility information\nabout an individual is a permitted CP disclosure in relation to the\nindividual if:\n\n(a) the disclosure is to one or more of the following (the\nrecipient):\n\n(i) an entity;\n\n(ii) a professional legal adviser of the entity;\n\n(iii) a professional financial adviser of the entity; and\n\n(b) the recipient has an Australian link; and\n\n(c) subsection (3) applies to the information."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21n-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Permission",
