    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21n-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "21N(3) Permitted CP disclosures to other recipients",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-21n-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.122",
      "values:originalText": "(3) This subsection applies to the credit eligibility information if the\nrecipient proposes to use the information:\n\n(a) in the process of the entity considering whether to:\n\n(i) accept an assignment of a debt owed to the credit\nprovider; or\n\n(ii) accept a debt owed to the provider as security for credit\nprovided to the provider; or\n\n(iii) purchase an interest in the provider or a related body\ncorporate of the provider; or\n\n(b) in connection with exercising rights arising from the\nacceptance of such an assignment or debt, or the purchase of\nsuch an interest.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) This subsection applies to the credit eligibility information if the\nrecipient proposes to use the information:\n\n(a) in the process of the entity considering whether to:\n\n(i) accept an assignment of a debt owed to the credit\nprovider; or\n\n(ii) accept a debt owed to the provider as security for credit\nprovided to the provider; or\n\n(iii) purchase an interest in the provider or a related body\ncorporate of the provider; or\n\n(b) in connection with exercising rights arising from the\nacceptance of such an assignment or debt, or the purchase of\nsuch an interest.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21n"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21n-ss-3-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "577b6a558775a4ede9ef6ad0f4b4171afac800dc3e5ce147a51b436d6dc9e288",
      "skos:note": "Permitted CP disclosures to other recipients"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-21n-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "21N(3) Permitted CP disclosures to other recipients",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 122,
      "values:originalText": "(3) This subsection applies to the credit eligibility information if the\nrecipient proposes to use the information:\n\n(a) in the process of the entity considering whether to:\n\n(i) accept an assignment of a debt owed to the credit\nprovider; or\n\n(ii) accept a debt owed to the provider as security for credit\nprovided to the provider; or\n\n(iii) purchase an interest in the provider or a related body\ncorporate of the provider; or\n\n(b) in connection with exercising rights arising from the\nacceptance of such an assignment or debt, or the purchase of\nsuch an interest."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21n-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Permission",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21n-ss-3"
