      "values:originalText": "(5) If the credit provider is an agency, the provider must not charge the\naccess seeker for the making of the request or for giving access to\nthe information.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nCredit reporting  Schedule 2\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15",
      "skos:definition": "(5) If the credit provider is an agency, the provider must not charge the\naccess seeker for the making of the request or for giving access to\nthe information.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nCredit reporting  Schedule 2\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15",
