        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-21u-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.129",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If a credit provider is an APP entity, Australian Privacy Principle\n13:\n\n(a) applies to the provider in relation to credit information or\ncredit eligibility information that is identification\ninformation; but\n\n(b) does not apply to the provider in relation to any other kind of\ncredit information or credit eligibility information.\nNote:\nIdentification information may be corrected under this section or\nAustralian Privacy Principle 13.\n21V  Individual may request the correction of credit information etc.\nRequest",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If a credit provider is an APP entity, Australian Privacy Principle\n13:\n\n(a) applies to the provider in relation to credit information or\ncredit eligibility information that is identification\ninformation; but\n\n(b) does not apply to the provider in relation to any other kind of\ncredit information or credit eligibility information.\nNote:\nIdentification information may be corrected under this section or\nAustralian Privacy Principle 13.\n21V  Individual may request the correction of credit information etc.\nRequest",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21u"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21u-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21u-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21u-ss-4-logic-deontic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21u-ss-4-logic-descriptionlogic-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2b2f6eb6db4202ac73ca037967a879b848c011cb51aac80896bbae632ba66848",
      "skos:note": "Use or disclosure of personal information for consultation purposes is authorized. Credit provider must comply with Australian Privacy Principle 13 when handling identification information."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-21u-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "21U(4) Correction of credit information or credit eligibility",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 129,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If a credit provider is an APP entity, Australian Privacy Principle\n13:\n\n(a) applies to the provider in relation to credit information or\ncredit eligibility information that is identification\ninformation; but\n\n(b) does not apply to the provider in relation to any other kind of\ncredit information or credit eligibility information.\nNote:\nIdentification information may be corrected under this section or\nAustralian Privacy Principle 13.\n21V  Individual may request the correction of credit information etc.\nRequest"
    },
