    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21u-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "21U(2) Correction of credit information or credit eligibility",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-21u-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.129",
      "values:originalText": "(2) If the credit provider is satisfied that the personal information is\ninaccurate, out-of-date, incomplete, irrelevant or misleading, the\nprovider must take such steps (if any) as are reasonable in the\ncircumstances to correct the information within:\n\n(a) the period of 30 days that starts on the day on which the\nrequest is made; or\n\n(b) such longer period as the individual has agreed to in writing.\nConsultation",
      "skos:definition": "(2) If the credit provider is satisfied that the personal information is\ninaccurate, out-of-date, incomplete, irrelevant or misleading, the\nprovider must take such steps (if any) as are reasonable in the\ncircumstances to correct the information within:\n\n(a) the period of 30 days that starts on the day on which the\nrequest is made; or\n\n(b) such longer period as the individual has agreed to in writing.\nConsultation",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21u"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21u-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21u-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "52f489fe514978bc11b84a6c15b62aae2b42279637b2f1326f4cec970a0a7bde",
      "skos:note": "Credit provider must correct personal information within a specified period. Provider must give written notice of correction within a reasonable period.",
      "dc:description": "Correcting personal information"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-21u-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "21U(2) Correction of credit information or credit eligibility",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 129,
      "values:originalText": "(2) If the credit provider is satisfied that the personal information is\ninaccurate, out-of-date, incomplete, irrelevant or misleading, the\nprovider must take such steps (if any) as are reasonable in the\ncircumstances to correct the information within:\n\n(a) the period of 30 days that starts on the day on which the\nrequest is made; or\n\n(b) such longer period as the individual has agreed to in writing.\nConsultation"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21u-ss-2-norm",
