    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21u-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "21U(3) Correction of credit information or credit eligibility",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-21u-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.129",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If the credit provider considers that the provider cannot be satisfied\nof the matter referred to in subsection (2) in relation to the personal\ninformation without consulting either or both of the following (the\ninterested party):\n\n(a) a credit reporting body that holds or held the information and\nthat has an Australian link;\n\n(b) another credit provider that holds or held the information and\nthat has an Australian link;\nthe provider must consult that interested party, or those interested\nparties, about the individual’s request.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If the credit provider considers that the provider cannot be satisfied\nof the matter referred to in subsection (2) in relation to the personal\ninformation without consulting either or both of the following (the\ninterested party):\n\n(a) a credit reporting body that holds or held the information and\nthat has an Australian link;\n\n(b) another credit provider that holds or held the information and\nthat has an Australian link;\nthe provider must consult that interested party, or those interested\nparties, about the individual’s request.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21u"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21u-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21u-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "fd9d057c2ab1480ace9d129fdf82faf64e7e38e84ded9ceec6cda0118828ca69",
      "skos:note": "Credit provider must consult interested party about individual's request. Credit provider must give notice under subsection (2) if able to do so.",
      "dc:description": "Consultation with interested parties"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-21u-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "21U(3) Correction of credit information or credit eligibility",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 129,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If the credit provider considers that the provider cannot be satisfied\nof the matter referred to in subsection (2) in relation to the personal\ninformation without consulting either or both of the following (the\ninterested party):\n\n(a) a credit reporting body that holds or held the information and\nthat has an Australian link;\n\n(b) another credit provider that holds or held the information and\nthat has an Australian link;\nthe provider must consult that interested party, or those interested\nparties, about the individual’s request."
    },
