      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.129",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The use or disclosure of personal information about the individual\nfor the purposes of the consultation is taken, for the purposes of\nthis Act, to be a use or disclosure that is authorised by this\nsubsection.\nNo charge",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The use or disclosure of personal information about the individual\nfor the purposes of the consultation is taken, for the purposes of\nthis Act, to be a use or disclosure that is authorised by this\nsubsection.\nNo charge",
