      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.129",
      "values:originalText": "(5) The credit provider must not charge the individual for the making\nof the request or for correcting the information.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nSchedule 2  Credit reporting\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\n\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\nInteraction with the Australian Privacy Principles",
      "skos:definition": "(5) The credit provider must not charge the individual for the making\nof the request or for correcting the information.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nSchedule 2  Credit reporting\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\n\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\nInteraction with the Australian Privacy Principles",
      "values:partOf": {
