    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21u-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "21U(6) Correction of credit information or credit eligibility",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-21u-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.129",
      "values:originalText": "(6) If a credit provider is an APP entity, Australian Privacy Principle\n13:\n\n(a) applies to the provider in relation to personal information\nreferred to in paragraph (1)(a) that is identification\ninformation; but\n\n(b) does not apply to the provider in relation to any other kind of\npersonal information referred to in that paragraph.\nNote:\nIdentification information may be corrected under this section or\nAustralian Privacy Principle 13.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) If a credit provider is an APP entity, Australian Privacy Principle\n13:\n\n(a) applies to the provider in relation to personal information\nreferred to in paragraph (1)(a) that is identification\ninformation; but\n\n(b) does not apply to the provider in relation to any other kind of\npersonal information referred to in that paragraph.\nNote:\nIdentification information may be corrected under this section or\nAustralian Privacy Principle 13.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21u"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21u-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21u-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21u-ss-6-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5352c0d217d069825c947ed9f8f68ae7f06600d997090f211b3e5fe6404239a9",
      "skos:note": "Credit provider must comply with Australian Privacy Principle 13 for personal information referred to in paragraph (1)(a) that is identification information."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-21u-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "21U(6) Correction of credit information or credit eligibility",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 129,
      "values:originalText": "(6) If a credit provider is an APP entity, Australian Privacy Principle\n13:\n\n(a) applies to the provider in relation to personal information\nreferred to in paragraph (1)(a) that is identification\ninformation; but\n\n(b) does not apply to the provider in relation to any other kind of\npersonal information referred to in that paragraph.\nNote:\nIdentification information may be corrected under this section or\nAustralian Privacy Principle 13."
    },
    {
