      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21w-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "21W(2) Notice of correction etc. must be given",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-21w-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.132",
      "values:originalText": "(2) If the credit provider corrects personal information about the\nindividual under subsection 21V(2), the provider must, within a\nreasonable period:\n\n(a) give the individual written notice of the correction; and\n\n(b) if the provider consulted an interested party under subsection\n21V(3) about the individual’s request—give the party written\nnotice of the correction; and\n\n(c) if the correction relates to information that the provider has\npreviously disclosed under:\n\n(i) this Division (other than subsection 21V(4)); or\n\n(ii) the Australian Privacy Principles (other than Australian\nPrivacy Principle 4.2);\n\ngive each recipient of the information written notice of the\ncorrection.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) If the credit provider corrects personal information about the\nindividual under subsection 21V(2), the provider must, within a\nreasonable period:\n\n(a) give the individual written notice of the correction; and\n\n(b) if the provider consulted an interested party under subsection\n21V(3) about the individual’s request—give the party written\nnotice of the correction; and\n\n(c) if the correction relates to information that the provider has\npreviously disclosed under:\n\n(i) this Division (other than subsection 21V(4)); or\n\n(ii) the Australian Privacy Principles (other than Australian\nPrivacy Principle 4.2);\n\ngive each recipient of the information written notice of the\ncorrection.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21w"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21w-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21w-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21w-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0a0fa349a5738bcf573fc84c25984fb77cf1dd34becb2a1b9afbab93c8d60362",
      "skos:note": "Credit provider must give written notice of correction to individual and recipients.",
      "dc:description": "written notice"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-21w-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "21W(2) Notice of correction etc. must be given",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 132,
      "values:originalText": "(2) If the credit provider corrects personal information about the\nindividual under subsection 21V(2), the provider must, within a\nreasonable period:\n\n(a) give the individual written notice of the correction; and\n\n(b) if the provider consulted an interested party under subsection\n21V(3) about the individual’s request—give the party written\nnotice of the correction; and\n\n(c) if the correction relates to information that the provider has\npreviously disclosed under:\n\n(i) this Division (other than subsection 21V(4)); or\n\n(ii) the Australian Privacy Principles (other than Australian\nPrivacy Principle 4.2);\n\ngive each recipient of the information written notice of the\ncorrection."
    },
