      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.132",
      "values:originalText": "(5) Subsection (2) or (3) does not apply if the credit provider is\nrequired by or under an Australian law, or a court/tribunal order,\nnot to give the notice under that subsection.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) Subsection (2) or (3) does not apply if the credit provider is\nrequired by or under an Australian law, or a court/tribunal order,\nnot to give the notice under that subsection.",
      "values:partOf": {
