      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.133",
      "values:originalText": "(5) An affected information recipient must take such steps as are\nreasonable in the circumstances to make the policy available:\n\n(a) free of charge; and\n\n(b) in such form as is appropriate.\nNote:\nAn affected information recipient will usually make the policy\navailable on the recipient’s website.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nCredit reporting  Schedule 2\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15",
      "skos:definition": "(5) An affected information recipient must take such steps as are\nreasonable in the circumstances to make the policy available:\n\n(a) free of charge; and\n\n(b) in such form as is appropriate.\nNote:\nAn affected information recipient will usually make the policy\navailable on the recipient’s website.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nCredit reporting  Schedule 2\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15",
