      "cml:integrityHash": "5d65da4e42fce3e71d2398371f960d8b091fb655c0a3aa649c2bdaea36b99b7e",
      "skos:note": "Recipient is exempt from APPII if an APP entity and the information is a government related identifier of the individual. Prohibition on use or disclosure of government related identifiers by APP entities Prohibition on use or disclosure of government related identifier information by APP entities"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-22d-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "22D(5) Use or disclosure of information by a related body corporate",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 137,
      "values:originalText": "(5) If:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nSchedule 2  Credit reporting\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\n\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n(a) the body corporate is an APP entity; and\n\n(b) the information is a government related identifier of the\nindividual;\nAustralian Privacy Principle 9.2 does not apply to the body in\nrelation to the information.\n22E  Use or disclosure of information by credit managers etc.\nProhibition on use or disclosure"
    },
