      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.137",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Subsection (1) does not apply to the disclosure of the information\nif:\n\n(a) the disclosure is to the credit provider; or\n\n(b) the disclosure is required or authorised by or under an\nAustralian law or a court/tribunal order.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nCredit reporting  Schedule 2\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\nInteraction with the Australian Privacy Principles",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Subsection (1) does not apply to the disclosure of the information\nif:\n\n(a) the disclosure is to the credit provider; or\n\n(b) the disclosure is required or authorised by or under an\nAustralian law or a court/tribunal order.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nCredit reporting  Schedule 2\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\nInteraction with the Australian Privacy Principles",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-22d"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-22d-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-22d-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-22d-ss-3-logic-deontic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c2c562299866ec7fa7b6f3c0601a0012817c448aa9e1ebbcbc1c8f1a39a12181",
      "skos:note": "Disclosure of information to credit provider or under Australian law is permitted. Permits use or disclosure of information by a related body corporate Disclosure of information is permitted if required or authorised by an Australian law or court/tribunal order."
    },
