    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-22d-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "22D(1) Use or disclosure of information by a related body corporate",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-22d-ss-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.137",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If:\n\n(a) any of the following (the recipient) holds or held credit\neligibility information about an individual:\n\n(i) an entity;\n\n(ii) a professional legal adviser of the entity;\n\n(iii) a professional financial adviser of the entity; and\n\n(b) the information was disclosed to the recipient by a credit\nprovider under subsection 21N(2);\nthe recipient must not use or disclose the information, or any\npersonal information about the individual derived from that\ninformation.\nCivil penalty:\n1,000 penalty units.\nPermitted uses",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If:\n\n(a) any of the following (the recipient) holds or held credit\neligibility information about an individual:\n\n(i) an entity;\n\n(ii) a professional legal adviser of the entity;\n\n(iii) a professional financial adviser of the entity; and\n\n(b) the information was disclosed to the recipient by a credit\nprovider under subsection 21N(2);\nthe recipient must not use or disclose the information, or any\npersonal information about the individual derived from that\ninformation.\nCivil penalty:\n1,000 penalty units.\nPermitted uses",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-22d"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
