      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.142",
      "values:originalText": "(5) The period for the purposes of subsection (4) is:\n\n(a) the period of 30 days that starts on the day on which the\ncomplaint is made; or\n\n(b) such longer period as the individual has agreed to in writing.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nCredit reporting  Schedule 2\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15",
      "skos:definition": "(5) The period for the purposes of subsection (4) is:\n\n(a) the period of 30 days that starts on the day on which the\ncomplaint is made; or\n\n(b) such longer period as the individual has agreed to in writing.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nCredit reporting  Schedule 2\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15",
      "values:partOf": {
