        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(6) Subsection (2), (3), (4) or (5)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-24-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "24 Obtaining credit reporting information from a credit reporting",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-24-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.144",
      "values:originalText": "body\nOffences\n\n(1) An entity commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the entity obtains credit reporting information; and\n\n(b) the information is obtained from a credit reporting body; and\n\n(c) the entity is not:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nCredit reporting  Schedule 2\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n(i) an entity to which the body is permitted to disclose the\ninformation under Division 2 of this Part; or\n\n(ii) an access seeker for the information.\nPenalty: 200 penalty units.\n\n(2) An entity commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the entity obtains credit reporting information; and\n\n(b) the information is obtained from a credit reporting body; and\n\n(c) the information is obtained by false pretence.\nPenalty: 200 penalty units.\nCivil penalties\n\n(3) An entity must not obtain credit reporting information from a credit\nreporting body if the entity is not:\n\n(a) an entity to which the body is permitted to disclose the\ninformation under Division 2 of this Part; or\n\n(b) an access seeker for the information.\nCivil penalty:\n2,000 penalty units.\n\n(4) An entity must not obtain, by false pretence, credit reporting\ninformation from a credit reporting body.\nCivil penalty:\n2,000 penalty units.",
      "skos:definition": "body\nOffences\n\n(1) An entity commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the entity obtains credit reporting information; and\n\n(b) the information is obtained from a credit reporting body; and\n\n(c) the entity is not:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nCredit reporting  Schedule 2\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n(i) an entity to which the body is permitted to disclose the\ninformation under Division 2 of this Part; or\n\n(ii) an access seeker for the information.\nPenalty: 200 penalty units.\n\n(2) An entity commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the entity obtains credit reporting information; and\n\n(b) the information is obtained from a credit reporting body; and\n\n(c) the information is obtained by false pretence.\nPenalty: 200 penalty units.\nCivil penalties\n\n(3) An entity must not obtain credit reporting information from a credit\nreporting body if the entity is not:\n\n(a) an entity to which the body is permitted to disclose the\ninformation under Division 2 of this Part; or\n\n(b) an access seeker for the information.\nCivil penalty:\n2,000 penalty units.\n\n(4) An entity must not obtain, by false pretence, credit reporting\ninformation from a credit reporting body.\nCivil penalty:\n2,000 penalty units.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-24-2-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-24-2-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-24-2-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-24-2-ss-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ae9c9714dbae5333dc1ba4c2c40dd7aaea1bea76af993eededcb48abfd305963"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-24-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "24 Obtaining credit reporting information from a credit reporting",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 144,
      "values:originalText": "body\nOffences\n\n(1) An entity commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the entity obtains credit reporting information; and\n\n(b) the information is obtained from a credit reporting body; and\n\n(c) the entity is not:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nCredit reporting  Schedule 2\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n(i) an entity to which the body is permitted to disclose the\ninformation under Division 2 of this Part; or\n\n(ii) an access seeker for the information.\nPenalty: 200 penalty units.\n\n(2) An entity commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the entity obtains credit reporting information; and\n\n(b) the information is obtained from a credit reporting body; and\n\n(c) the information is obtained by false pretence.\nPenalty: 200 penalty units.\nCivil penalties\n\n(3) An entity must not obtain credit reporting information from a credit\nreporting body if the entity is not:\n\n(a) an entity to which the body is permitted to disclose the\ninformation under Division 2 of this Part; or\n\n(b) an access seeker for the information.\nCivil penalty:\n2,000 penalty units.\n\n(4) An entity must not obtain, by false pretence, credit reporting\ninformation from a credit reporting body.\nCivil penalty:\n2,000 penalty units."
    },
    {
