      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.147",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The court may make the order only if:\n\n(a) the person applies for an order under this section; and\n\n(b) the application is made within 6 years of the day the cause of\naction that relates to the contravention or commission of the\noffence accrued.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The court may make the order only if:\n\n(a) the person applies for an order under this section; and\n\n(b) the application is made within 6 years of the day the cause of\naction that relates to the contravention or commission of the\noffence accrued.",
