      "cml:integrityHash": "4914f659886d04740a53f91886ff5b91d1e58db33f185b47712ca799fa3b5658",
      "skos:note": "Court may make order to compensate loss or damage within 6 years of the cause of action."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-2-sec-25a-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "25A(4) Other orders to compensate loss or damage",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 147,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The court may make the order only if:\n\n(a) the person applies for an order under this section; and\n\n(b) the application is made within 6 years of the day the cause of\naction that relates to the contravention or commission of the\noffence accrued."
    },
