      "values:originalText": "(1) A registered APP code is an APP code:\n\n(a) that is included on the Codes Register; and\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nSchedule 3  Privacy codes\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\n\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n(b) that is in force.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A registered APP code is an APP code:\n\n(a) that is included on the Codes Register; and\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nSchedule 3  Privacy codes\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\n\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n(b) that is in force.",
      "values:partOf": {
