      "cml:integrityHash": "c706025709a30b6d20f7eda254f0b7e2734f18e6dc0ded238f5ea99559eb637f",
      "skos:note": "A registered APP code is an APP code included on the Codes Register and in force."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-3-sec-26b-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26B(1) What is a registered APP code",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 153,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A registered APP code is an APP code:\n\n(a) that is included on the Codes Register; and\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nSchedule 3  Privacy codes\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\n\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n(b) that is in force."
    },
