    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-3-sec-26c-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26C(4) What is an APP code",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 154,
      "values:originalText": "(4) An APP code may be expressed to apply to any one or more of the\nfollowing:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nPrivacy codes  Schedule 3\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n(a) all personal information or a specified type of personal\ninformation;\n\n(b) a specified activity, or a specified class of activities, of an\nAPP entity;\n\n(c) a specified industry sector or profession, or a specified class\nof industry sectors or professions;\n\n(d) APP entities that use technology of a specified kind."
    },
