      "cof:title": "26E(2) Development of APP codes by APP code developers",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 155,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Commissioner may, in writing, request an APP code developer\nto develop an APP code, and apply to the Commissioner for the\ncode to be registered, if the Commissioner is satisfied it is in the\npublic interest for the code to be developed."
