      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.155",
      "values:originalText": "(5) The request may:\n\n(a) specify one or more matters that the APP code must deal\nwith; and\n\n(b) specify the APP entities, or a class of APP entities, that\nshould be bound by the code.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) The request may:\n\n(a) specify one or more matters that the APP code must deal\nwith; and\n\n(b) specify the APP entities, or a class of APP entities, that\nshould be bound by the code.",
      "values:partOf": {
