        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "58b4e634960eaeffc230da848705173faaf83fdec76b7a3b52273c8465d2da90",
      "skos:note": "Specify matters and entities bound by the APP code"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-3-sec-26e-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26E(5) Development of APP codes by APP code developers",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 155,
      "values:originalText": "(5) The request may:\n\n(a) specify one or more matters that the APP code must deal\nwith; and\n\n(b) specify the APP entities, or a class of APP entities, that\nshould be bound by the code."
    },
    {
