    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26e-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "26E(6) Development of APP codes by APP code developers",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-3-sec-26e-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.155",
      "values:originalText": "(6) Despite paragraph (5)(a), the Commissioner must not require an\nAPP code to cover an act or practice that is exempt within the\nmeaning of subsection 7B(1), (2) or (3). However, the APP code\nthat is developed by the APP code developer may cover such an act\nor practice.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) Despite paragraph (5)(a), the Commissioner must not require an\nAPP code to cover an act or practice that is exempt within the\nmeaning of subsection 7B(1), (2) or (3). However, the APP code\nthat is developed by the APP code developer may cover such an act\nor practice.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26e"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26e-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26e-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "74728eee7ef7b2cc63595af194f245a8b6c537268f257a9d63ebd6808e0c6cdb",
      "skos:note": "Commissioner cannot require APP code to cover exempt act or practice."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-3-sec-26e-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26E(6) Development of APP codes by APP code developers",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 155,
      "values:originalText": "(6) Despite paragraph (5)(a), the Commissioner must not require an\nAPP code to cover an act or practice that is exempt within the\nmeaning of subsection 7B(1), (2) or (3). However, the APP code\nthat is developed by the APP code developer may cover such an act\nor practice."
    },
    {
