      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.155",
      "values:originalText": "(7) The Commissioner must make a copy of the request publicly\navailable as soon as practicable after the request is made.",
      "skos:definition": "(7) The Commissioner must make a copy of the request publicly\navailable as soon as practicable after the request is made.",
