    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26f",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "26F Application for registration of APP codes",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-3-sec-26f"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.156",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If an APP code developer develops an APP code, the developer\nmay apply to the Commissioner for registration of the code.\n\n(2) Before making the application, the APP code developer must:\n\n(a) make a draft of the APP code publicly available; and\n\n(b) invite the public to make submissions to the developer about\nthe draft within a specified period (which must run for at\nleast 28 days); and\n\n(c) give consideration to any submissions made within the\nspecified period.\n\n(3) The application must:\n\n(a) be made in the form and manner specified by the\nCommissioner; and\n\n(b) be accompanied by such information as is specified by the\nCommissioner.\n\n(4) The APP code developer may vary the APP code at any time\nbefore the Commissioner registers the code, but only with the\nconsent of the Commissioner.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nPrivacy codes  Schedule 3\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If an APP code developer develops an APP code, the developer\nmay apply to the Commissioner for registration of the code.\n\n(2) Before making the application, the APP code developer must:\n\n(a) make a draft of the APP code publicly available; and\n\n(b) invite the public to make submissions to the developer about\nthe draft within a specified period (which must run for at\nleast 28 days); and\n\n(c) give consideration to any submissions made within the\nspecified period.\n\n(3) The application must:\n\n(a) be made in the form and manner specified by the\nCommissioner; and\n\n(b) be accompanied by such information as is specified by the\nCommissioner.\n\n(4) The APP code developer may vary the APP code at any time\nbefore the Commissioner registers the code, but only with the\nconsent of the Commissioner.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nPrivacy codes  Schedule 3\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26f-ss-1"
