      "cml:integrityHash": "314df8389f8c4bb7192a59d37e0fe3d1254be19e5663ba3645d81c9aa4b0bbf5",
      "skos:note": "Commissioner may register APP codes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-3-sec-26h-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26H(1) Commissioner may register APP codes",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 157,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If:\n\n(a) an application for registration of an APP code is made under\nsection 26F; or\n\n(b) the Commissioner develops an APP code under section 26G;\nthe Commissioner may register the code by including it on the\nCodes Register."
    },
