    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26j-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "26J(4) Variation of registered APP codes",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-3-sec-26j-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.158",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Before deciding whether to approve a variation, the Commissioner\nmust:\n\n(a) make a draft of the variation publicly available; and\n\n(b) consult any person the Commissioner considers appropriate\nabout the variation; and\n\n(c)  consider the extent to which members of the public have\nbeen given an opportunity to comment on the variation.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Before deciding whether to approve a variation, the Commissioner\nmust:\n\n(a) make a draft of the variation publicly available; and\n\n(b) consult any person the Commissioner considers appropriate\nabout the variation; and\n\n(c)  consider the extent to which members of the public have\nbeen given an opportunity to comment on the variation.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26j"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26j-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26j-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "021a17ce648b0d89838b56c2d0fcd2c33c6592071f916e36104ebda705f4b318",
      "skos:note": "Commissioner must consult and consider public comments before approving a variation.",
      "dc:description": "Draft of the variation and opportunity for public comment"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-3-sec-26j-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26J(4) Variation of registered APP codes",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 158,
      "values:originalText": "(4) Before deciding whether to approve a variation, the Commissioner\nmust:\n\n(a) make a draft of the variation publicly available; and\n\n(b) consult any person the Commissioner considers appropriate\nabout the variation; and\n\n(c)  consider the extent to which members of the public have\nbeen given an opportunity to comment on the variation."
    },
    {
