    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26j-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "26J(6) Variation of registered APP codes",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-3-sec-26j-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.158",
      "values:originalText": "(6) If the Commissioner approves a variation of a registered APP code\n(the original code), the Commissioner must:\n\n(a) remove the original code from the Codes Register; and\n\n(b) register the APP code, as varied, by including it on the\nRegister.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) If the Commissioner approves a variation of a registered APP code\n(the original code), the Commissioner must:\n\n(a) remove the original code from the Codes Register; and\n\n(b) register the APP code, as varied, by including it on the\nRegister.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26j"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26j-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26j-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "accdda124dd576ae4e51037364475bc838ac4c258e03a8275c6079b3b47fd90b",
      "skos:note": "Commissioner must remove original code and register varied APP code"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-3-sec-26j-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26J(6) Variation of registered APP codes",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 158,
      "values:originalText": "(6) If the Commissioner approves a variation of a registered APP code\n(the original code), the Commissioner must:\n\n(a) remove the original code from the Codes Register; and\n\n(b) register the APP code, as varied, by including it on the\nRegister."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26j-ss-6-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
