    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26l",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "26L Entities to comply with the registered CR code if bound by the",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-3-sec-26l"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.160",
      "values:originalText": "code\n\nIf an entity is bound by the registered CR code, the entity must not\ndo an act, or engage in a practice, that breaches the code.\nNote:\nThere must always be one, and only one, registered CR code at all\ntimes after this Part commences: see subsection 26S(4).",
      "skos:definition": "code\n\nIf an entity is bound by the registered CR code, the entity must not\ndo an act, or engage in a practice, that breaches the code.\nNote:\nThere must always be one, and only one, registered CR code at all\ntimes after this Part commences: see subsection 26S(4).",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26l-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26l-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d587dd1bfb3d2aa585c84f3c889f0a9fd0f82bc5cec9b317c417e32742e70152",
      "skos:note": "Entity must not breach the CR code"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-3-sec-26l",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26L Entities to comply with the registered CR code if bound by the",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 160,
      "values:originalText": "code\n\nIf an entity is bound by the registered CR code, the entity must not\ndo an act, or engage in a practice, that breaches the code.\nNote:\nThere must always be one, and only one, registered CR code at all\ntimes after this Part commences: see subsection 26S(4)."
    },
    {
