    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26r-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "26R(2) Development of CR code by the Commissioner",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-3-sec-26r-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.162",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Before registering the CR code under section 26S, the\nCommissioner must:\n\n(a) make a draft of the code publicly available; and\n\n(b) invite the public to make submissions to the Commissioner\nabout the draft within a specified period (which must run for\nat least 28 days); and\n\n(c) give consideration to any submissions made within the\nspecified period.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Before registering the CR code under section 26S, the\nCommissioner must:\n\n(a) make a draft of the code publicly available; and\n\n(b) invite the public to make submissions to the Commissioner\nabout the draft within a specified period (which must run for\nat least 28 days); and\n\n(c) give consideration to any submissions made within the\nspecified period.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26r"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26r-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26r-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "65ddacc645547b2f8d114469f93fb73df3162b1dce9a41e834c260600030db90",
      "skos:note": "Commissioner must make draft publicly available and invite public submissions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-3-sec-26r-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26R(2) Development of CR code by the Commissioner",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 162,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Before registering the CR code under section 26S, the\nCommissioner must:\n\n(a) make a draft of the code publicly available; and\n\n(b) invite the public to make submissions to the Commissioner\nabout the draft within a specified period (which must run for\nat least 28 days); and\n\n(c) give consideration to any submissions made within the\nspecified period."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26r-ss-2-norm",
