      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.164",
      "values:originalText": "(5) If the Commissioner approves a variation of the registered CR code\n(the original code), the Commissioner must:\n\n(a) remove the original code from the Codes Register; and\n\n(b) register the CR code, as varied, by including it on the\nRegister.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) If the Commissioner approves a variation of the registered CR code\n(the original code), the Commissioner must:\n\n(a) remove the original code from the Codes Register; and\n\n(b) register the CR code, as varied, by including it on the\nRegister.",
      "values:partOf": {
