      "skos:note": "Commissioner must remove original code and register varied CR code"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-3-sec-26t-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26T(5) Variation of the registered CR code",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 164,
      "values:originalText": "(5) If the Commissioner approves a variation of the registered CR code\n(the original code), the Commissioner must:\n\n(a) remove the original code from the Codes Register; and\n\n(b) register the CR code, as varied, by including it on the\nRegister."
    },
