      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.164",
      "values:originalText": "(6) If the Commissioner approves a variation, the variation comes into\neffect on the day specified in the approval, which must not be\nbefore the day on which the CR code, as varied, is included on the\nCodes Register.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nPrivacy codes  Schedule 3\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15",
      "skos:definition": "(6) If the Commissioner approves a variation, the variation comes into\neffect on the day specified in the approval, which must not be\nbefore the day on which the CR code, as varied, is included on the\nCodes Register.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nPrivacy codes  Schedule 3\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15",
      "values:partOf": {
