    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26u",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "26U Codes Register",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-3-sec-26u"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.165",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Commissioner must keep a register (the Codes Register)\nwhich includes:\n\n(a) the APP codes the Commissioner has decided to register\nunder section 26H; and\n\n(b) the APP codes the Commissioner must register under\nsection 26J; and\n\n(c) the CR code the Commissioner has decided to register under\nsection 26S; and\n\n(d) the CR code the Commissioner must register under\nsection 26T.\n\n(2) Despite subsection (1), the Commissioner is not required to include\non the Codes Register:\n\n(a) an APP code removed from the Register under section 26J or\n26K; or\n\n(b) the CR code removed from the Register under section 26T.\n\n(3) The Commissioner must make the Codes Register available on the\nCommissioner’s website.\n\n(4) The Commissioner may charge fees for providing copies of, or\nextracts from, the Codes Register.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Commissioner must keep a register (the Codes Register)\nwhich includes:\n\n(a) the APP codes the Commissioner has decided to register\nunder section 26H; and\n\n(b) the APP codes the Commissioner must register under\nsection 26J; and\n\n(c) the CR code the Commissioner has decided to register under\nsection 26S; and\n\n(d) the CR code the Commissioner must register under\nsection 26T.\n\n(2) Despite subsection (1), the Commissioner is not required to include\non the Codes Register:\n\n(a) an APP code removed from the Register under section 26J or\n26K; or\n\n(b) the CR code removed from the Register under section 26T.\n\n(3) The Commissioner must make the Codes Register available on the\nCommissioner’s website.\n\n(4) The Commissioner may charge fees for providing copies of, or\nextracts from, the Codes Register.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26u-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26u-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26u-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26u-ss-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "64fe3cd79b931a5af7ff84ced50b444b4cb7cbe0d1738c353d922e0c9f54353e"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-3-sec-26u",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26U Codes Register",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 165,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Commissioner must keep a register (the Codes Register)\nwhich includes:\n\n(a) the APP codes the Commissioner has decided to register\nunder section 26H; and\n\n(b) the APP codes the Commissioner must register under\nsection 26J; and\n\n(c) the CR code the Commissioner has decided to register under\nsection 26S; and\n\n(d) the CR code the Commissioner must register under\nsection 26T.\n\n(2) Despite subsection (1), the Commissioner is not required to include\non the Codes Register:\n\n(a) an APP code removed from the Register under section 26J or\n26K; or\n\n(b) the CR code removed from the Register under section 26T.\n\n(3) The Commissioner must make the Codes Register available on the\nCommissioner’s website.\n\n(4) The Commissioner may charge fees for providing copies of, or\nextracts from, the Codes Register."
    },
    {
