      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.165",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Despite subsection (1), the Commissioner is not required to include\non the Codes Register:\n\n(a) an APP code removed from the Register under section 26J or\n26K; or\n\n(b) the CR code removed from the Register under section 26T.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Despite subsection (1), the Commissioner is not required to include\non the Codes Register:\n\n(a) an APP code removed from the Register under section 26J or\n26K; or\n\n(b) the CR code removed from the Register under section 26T.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26u"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
