        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f63f8a82273068194a5629e19156abfc1db062b75453dda36053d42f92f84121",
      "skos:note": "The Commissioner is not required to include certain codes on the Codes Register."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-3-sec-26u-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26U(2) Codes Register",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 165,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Despite subsection (1), the Commissioner is not required to include\non the Codes Register:\n\n(a) an APP code removed from the Register under section 26J or\n26K; or\n\n(b) the CR code removed from the Register under section 26T."
    },
