      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.166",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Commissioner may review the operation of a registered APP\ncode.\nNote:\nThe review may inform a decision by the Commissioner to approve a\nvariation of a registered APP code or to remove a registered APP code\nfrom the Codes Register.\n\n(2) The Commissioner may review the operation of the registered CR\ncode.\nNote:\nThe review may inform a decision by the Commissioner to approve a\nvariation of the registered CR code.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Commissioner may review the operation of a registered APP\ncode.\nNote:\nThe review may inform a decision by the Commissioner to approve a\nvariation of a registered APP code or to remove a registered APP code\nfrom the Codes Register.\n\n(2) The Commissioner may review the operation of the registered CR\ncode.\nNote:\nThe review may inform a decision by the Commissioner to approve a\nvariation of the registered CR code.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26w-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26w-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2cfbaf2e392783c2d2aacb2ebc001dfeda7e40211e1652bc40cad58437219b11"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-3-sec-26w",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26W Review of operation of registered codes",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 166,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Commissioner may review the operation of a registered APP\ncode.\nNote:\nThe review may inform a decision by the Commissioner to approve a\nvariation of a registered APP code or to remove a registered APP code\nfrom the Codes Register.\n\n(2) The Commissioner may review the operation of the registered CR\ncode.\nNote:\nThe review may inform a decision by the Commissioner to approve a\nvariation of the registered CR code."
    },
