      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.173",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Without limiting its effect apart from this section, this Act has\neffect in relation to the following (the regulated entities) as\nprovided by this section:\n\n(a) an agency;\n\n(b) an organisation;\n\n(c) a small business operator;\n\n(d) a body politic.\nNote:\nSubsection 27(4) applies in relation to an investigation of an act or\npractice referred to in subsection 29(1) of the Healthcare Identifiers\nAct 2010.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Without limiting its effect apart from this section, this Act has\neffect in relation to the following (the regulated entities) as\nprovided by this section:\n\n(a) an agency;\n\n(b) an organisation;\n\n(c) a small business operator;\n\n(d) a body politic.\nNote:\nSubsection 27(4) applies in relation to an investigation of an act or\npractice referred to in subsection 29(1) of the Healthcare Identifiers\nAct 2010.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-35"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
