          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-35-ss-1-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5da27cfd6d0b95df53b59b9287caccd5e8cf60679113290631cff855cd6d870d",
      "skos:note": "Regulated entities subject to the Act's effect"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-4-sec-35-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "35(1) Subsections 12B(1) and (2)",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 173,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Without limiting its effect apart from this section, this Act has\neffect in relation to the following (the regulated entities) as\nprovided by this section:\n\n(a) an agency;\n\n(b) an organisation;\n\n(c) a small business operator;\n\n(d) a body politic.\nNote:\nSubsection 27(4) applies in relation to an investigation of an act or\npractice referred to in subsection 29(1) of the Healthcare Identifiers\nAct 2010."
    },
    {
