    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-35-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "35(2) Subsections 12B(1) and (2)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-4-sec-35-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.173",
      "values:originalText": "(2) This Act also has the effect it would have if its operation in relation\nto regulated entities were expressly confined to an operation to\ngive effect to the following:\n\n(a) the International Covenant on Civil and Political Rights done\nat New York on 16 December 1966 ([1980] ATS 23), and in\nparticular Articles 17 and 24(1) of the Covenant;\n\n(b) Article 16 of the Convention on the Rights of the Child done\nat New York on 20 November 1989 ([1991] ATS 4).\nNote:\nIn 2012, the text of the Covenant and Convention in the Australian\nTreaty Series was accessible through the Australian Treaties Library\non the AustLII website (www.austlii.edu.au).",
      "skos:definition": "(2) This Act also has the effect it would have if its operation in relation\nto regulated entities were expressly confined to an operation to\ngive effect to the following:\n\n(a) the International Covenant on Civil and Political Rights done\nat New York on 16 December 1966 ([1980] ATS 23), and in\nparticular Articles 17 and 24(1) of the Covenant;\n\n(b) Article 16 of the Convention on the Rights of the Child done\nat New York on 20 November 1989 ([1991] ATS 4).\nNote:\nIn 2012, the text of the Covenant and Convention in the Australian\nTreaty Series was accessible through the Australian Treaties Library\non the AustLII website (www.austlii.edu.au).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-35"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-35-ss-2-norm"
