    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-13-2-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "13(4) Interferences with privacy",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-4-sec-13-2-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.174",
      "values:originalText": "(4) An act or practice is an interference with the privacy of an\nindividual if:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nSchedule 4  Other amendments of the Privacy Act 1988\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\n\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n(a) it is an act or practice of a file number recipient and the act or\npractice breaches a rule issued under section 17 in relation to\ntax file number information that relates to the individual; or\n\n(b) the act or practice involves an unauthorised requirement or\nrequest for disclosure of the tax file number of the individual.\nOther interferences with privacy",
      "skos:definition": "(4) An act or practice is an interference with the privacy of an\nindividual if:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nSchedule 4  Other amendments of the Privacy Act 1988\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\n\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n(a) it is an act or practice of a file number recipient and the act or\npractice breaches a rule issued under section 17 in relation to\ntax file number information that relates to the individual; or\n\n(b) the act or practice involves an unauthorised requirement or\nrequest for disclosure of the tax file number of the individual.\nOther interferences with privacy",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-13-2"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-13-2-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-13-2-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7f53369b61fd9167350aa212c6175864a3e5cebf76c807aaffa12d785d7bd835",
      "skos:note": "Interference with tax file number information is prohibited."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-4-sec-13-2-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "13(4) Interferences with privacy",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 174,
      "values:originalText": "(4) An act or practice is an interference with the privacy of an\nindividual if:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nSchedule 4  Other amendments of the Privacy Act 1988\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\n\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n(a) it is an act or practice of a file number recipient and the act or\npractice breaches a rule issued under section 17 in relation to\ntax file number information that relates to the individual; or\n\n(b) the act or practice involves an unauthorised requirement or\nrequest for disclosure of the tax file number of the individual.\nOther interferences with privacy"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-13-2-ss-4-norm",
