      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.178",
      "values:originalText": "The Commissioner must, by legislative instrument, issue rules\nconcerning the collection, storage, use and security of tax file\nnumber information.",
      "skos:definition": "The Commissioner must, by legislative instrument, issue rules\nconcerning the collection, storage, use and security of tax file\nnumber information.",
