      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.182",
      "values:originalText": "After “credit provider” (first occurring), insert “that is an interference\nwith the privacy of an individual under subsection 13(1), (2) or (4)”.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nOther amendments of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 4\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15",
      "skos:definition": "After “credit provider” (first occurring), insert “that is an interference\nwith the privacy of an individual under subsection 13(1), (2) or (4)”.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nOther amendments of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 4\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-57-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-57-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "09682cd9005cd7c4df708b0667d564db257b6b44f5c9b79d17eba98a7ff47d46",
      "skos:note": "Interference with individual privacy is prohibited."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-4-sec-57",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "57 Subsection 30(3)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 182,
      "values:originalText": "After “credit provider” (first occurring), insert “that is an interference\nwith the privacy of an individual under subsection 13(1), (2) or (4)”.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nOther amendments of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 4\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15"
    },
