      "cml:premiseText": "The Commissioner has monitored certain activities.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The Commissioner must report to the Minister."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-62",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "62 Subsection 32(1)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-4-sec-62"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.183",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n\n(1) If the Commissioner has:\n\n(a) monitored an activity in the performance of a function under\nparagraph 28(1)(d), 28A(1)(a), (b), (d) or (e) or (2)(b), (c) or\n(d) or 28B(1)(b) or (c); or\n\n(b) conducted an assessment under section 33C;\nthe Commissioner may report to the Minister about the activity or\nassessment, and must do so if so directed by the Minister.",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n\n(1) If the Commissioner has:\n\n(a) monitored an activity in the performance of a function under\nparagraph 28(1)(d), 28A(1)(a), (b), (d) or (e) or (2)(b), (c) or\n(d) or 28B(1)(b) or (c); or\n\n(b) conducted an assessment under section 33C;\nthe Commissioner may report to the Minister about the activity or\nassessment, and must do so if so directed by the Minister.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-62-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-62-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a2884af8e7763dd28f08233fe7c4421e123337e490e70c0bf7d418791c578c62",
      "skos:note": "The Commissioner must report to the Minister about an activity or assessment if directed."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-4-sec-62",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "62 Subsection 32(1)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 183,
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n\n(1) If the Commissioner has:\n\n(a) monitored an activity in the performance of a function under\nparagraph 28(1)(d), 28A(1)(a), (b), (d) or (e) or (2)(b), (c) or\n(d) or 28B(1)(b) or (c); or\n\n(b) conducted an assessment under section 33C;\nthe Commissioner may report to the Minister about the activity or\nassessment, and must do so if so directed by the Minister."
    },
