      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.184",
      "values:originalText": "(6) If an agency does not comply with a direction under subsection (1),\nthe Commissioner must advise both of the following of the failure:\n\n(a) the Minister;\n\n(b) if another Minister is responsible for the agency—that other\nMinister.\nReview",
      "skos:definition": "(6) If an agency does not comply with a direction under subsection (1),\nthe Commissioner must advise both of the following of the failure:\n\n(a) the Minister;\n\n(b) if another Minister is responsible for the agency—that other\nMinister.\nReview",
      "values:partOf": {
