      "skos:note": "Agency must comply with direction from Commissioner regarding privacy impact."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-4-sec-33d-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "33D(6) Commissioner may direct an agency to give a privacy impact",
