      "values:originalText": "(4) If a notification is given under subsection (3), the Commissioner\nmay decide not to investigate, or not to investigate further, the act\nor practice.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If a notification is given under subsection (3), the Commissioner\nmay decide not to investigate, or not to investigate further, the act\nor practice.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-40a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
