      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.191",
      "values:originalText": "Omit “or lacking in substance;”, substitute “, lacking in substance or not\nmade in good faith; or”.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nSchedule 4  Other amendments of the Privacy Act 1988\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\n\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15",
      "skos:definition": "Omit “or lacking in substance;”, substitute “, lacking in substance or not\nmade in good faith; or”.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nSchedule 4  Other amendments of the Privacy Act 1988\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\n\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15",
