      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.192",
      "values:originalText": "Add:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nOther amendments of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 4\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n(2) The Commissioner may make inquiries of any person for the\npurpose of determining whether to investigate an act or practice\nunder subsection 40(2).",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nOther amendments of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 4\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n(2) The Commissioner may make inquiries of any person for the\npurpose of determining whether to investigate an act or practice\nunder subsection 40(2).",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-91-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-91-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e84be4696e47d23eb906ed21000433b3b5fce57412c78464d694a3b5ad29de39",
      "skos:note": "The Commissioner may make inquiries of any person for the purpose of determining whether to investigate an act or practice under subsection 40(2)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-4-sec-91",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "91 At the end of section 42",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 192,
      "values:originalText": "Add:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nOther amendments of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 4\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n(2) The Commissioner may make inquiries of any person for the\npurpose of determining whether to investigate an act or practice\nunder subsection 40(2)."
    },
