    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-43a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "43A Interested party may request a hearing",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-4-sec-43a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.194",
      "values:originalText": "(1) An interested party in relation to an investigation under this\nDivision may, in writing, request that the Commissioner hold a\nhearing before the Commissioner makes a determination under\nsection 52 in relation to the investigation.\n\n(2) If an interested party makes request under subsection (1), the\nCommissioner must:\n\n(a) notify any other interested party of the request; and\n\n(b) give all interested parties a reasonable opportunity to make a\nsubmission about the request; and\n\n(c) decide whether or not to hold a hearing.\n\n(3) In this section:\ninterested party in relation to an investigation means:\n\n(a) in the case of an investigation under subsection 40(1)—the\ncomplainant or respondent; or\n\n(b) otherwise—the person or entity that engaged in the act or\npractice that is being investigated.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) An interested party in relation to an investigation under this\nDivision may, in writing, request that the Commissioner hold a\nhearing before the Commissioner makes a determination under\nsection 52 in relation to the investigation.\n\n(2) If an interested party makes request under subsection (1), the\nCommissioner must:\n\n(a) notify any other interested party of the request; and\n\n(b) give all interested parties a reasonable opportunity to make a\nsubmission about the request; and\n\n(c) decide whether or not to hold a hearing.\n\n(3) In this section:\ninterested party in relation to an investigation means:\n\n(a) in the case of an investigation under subsection 40(1)—the\ncomplainant or respondent; or\n\n(b) otherwise—the person or entity that engaged in the act or\npractice that is being investigated.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-43a-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-43a-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-43a-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "900949027cdd839322737c9ef244e45e97f9d0401eb20ecf9faa04e141012cf0"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-4-sec-43a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "43A Interested party may request a hearing",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 194,
      "values:originalText": "(1) An interested party in relation to an investigation under this\nDivision may, in writing, request that the Commissioner hold a\nhearing before the Commissioner makes a determination under\nsection 52 in relation to the investigation.\n\n(2) If an interested party makes request under subsection (1), the\nCommissioner must:\n\n(a) notify any other interested party of the request; and\n\n(b) give all interested parties a reasonable opportunity to make a\nsubmission about the request; and\n\n(c) decide whether or not to hold a hearing.\n\n(3) In this section:\ninterested party in relation to an investigation means:\n\n(a) in the case of an investigation under subsection 40(1)—the\ncomplainant or respondent; or\n\n(b) otherwise—the person or entity that engaged in the act or\npractice that is being investigated."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-43a-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "43A(1) Interested party may request a hearing",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-4-sec-43a-ss-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
