      "cof:title": "43A(1) Interested party may request a hearing",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 194,
      "values:originalText": "(1) An interested party in relation to an investigation under this\nDivision may, in writing, request that the Commissioner hold a\nhearing before the Commissioner makes a determination under\nsection 52 in relation to the investigation."
    },
