    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-43a-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "43A(2) Interested party may request a hearing",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-4-sec-43a-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.194",
      "values:originalText": "(2) If an interested party makes request under subsection (1), the\nCommissioner must:\n\n(a) notify any other interested party of the request; and\n\n(b) give all interested parties a reasonable opportunity to make a\nsubmission about the request; and\n\n(c) decide whether or not to hold a hearing.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) If an interested party makes request under subsection (1), the\nCommissioner must:\n\n(a) notify any other interested party of the request; and\n\n(b) give all interested parties a reasonable opportunity to make a\nsubmission about the request; and\n\n(c) decide whether or not to hold a hearing.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-43a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-43a-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-43a-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4e97b290ddb953bb8d00c5569df8720f485f76cdd00959eaf06407b79b5f86af",
      "skos:note": "Commissioner must notify and give opportunity to make submission about request."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-4-sec-43a-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "43A(2) Interested party may request a hearing",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 194,
      "values:originalText": "(2) If an interested party makes request under subsection (1), the\nCommissioner must:\n\n(a) notify any other interested party of the request; and\n\n(b) give all interested parties a reasonable opportunity to make a\nsubmission about the request; and\n\n(c) decide whether or not to hold a hearing."
    },
    {
