      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.194",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nOther amendments of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 4\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\nalternative complaint body means:\n\n(a) the Australian Human Rights Commission; or\n\n(b) the Ombudsman; or\n\n(c) the Postal Industry Ombudsman; or\n\n(d) the Overseas Students Ombudsman; or\n\n(e) the Public Service Commissioner; or\n\n(f) the Norfolk Island Public Service Board; or\n\n(g) a recognised external dispute resolution scheme.",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nOther amendments of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 4\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\nalternative complaint body means:\n\n(a) the Australian Human Rights Commission; or\n\n(b) the Ombudsman; or\n\n(c) the Postal Industry Ombudsman; or\n\n(d) the Overseas Students Ombudsman; or\n\n(e) the Public Service Commissioner; or\n\n(f) the Norfolk Island Public Service Board; or\n\n(g) a recognised external dispute resolution scheme.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-100-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-100-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-100-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-100-logic-alleninterval-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6e5de1895187e5c87a8ed6fbbad3472446723a025ef161ceda0ef5ddf6663342",
      "skos:note": "List of alternative complaint bodies"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-4-sec-100",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "100 Subsection 50(1)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 194,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nOther amendments of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 4\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\nalternative complaint body means:\n\n(a) the Australian Human Rights Commission; or\n\n(b) the Ombudsman; or\n\n(c) the Postal Industry Ombudsman; or\n\n(d) the Overseas Students Ombudsman; or\n\n(e) the Public Service Commissioner; or\n\n(f) the Norfolk Island Public Service Board; or\n\n(g) a recognised external dispute resolution scheme."
    },
