      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsections, substitute:\n\n(3A) A determination under paragraph (1)(b) or subsection (1A) may\ninclude any order that the Commissioner considers necessary or\nappropriate.",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the subsections, substitute:\n\n(3A) A determination under paragraph (1)(b) or subsection (1A) may\ninclude any order that the Commissioner considers necessary or\nappropriate.",
