      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.203",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(1A) If:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nSchedule 4  Other amendments of the Privacy Act 1988\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\n\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n(a) an application is made under subsection (1); and\n\n(b) the Commissioner is satisfied that the application is frivolous,\nvexatious, misconceived, lacking in substance or not made in\ngood faith;\nthe Commissioner may, in writing, dismiss the application.",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n\n(1A) If:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nSchedule 4  Other amendments of the Privacy Act 1988\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\n\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n(a) an application is made under subsection (1); and\n\n(b) the Commissioner is satisfied that the application is frivolous,\nvexatious, misconceived, lacking in substance or not made in\ngood faith;\nthe Commissioner may, in writing, dismiss the application.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-166-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-166-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7ca16c0c540516d887f2e8c6ce3415519d479e5d3d73f53593fe269cf59d313c",
      "skos:note": "Dismiss frivolous privacy application"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-4-sec-166",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "166 After subsection 73(1)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 203,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(1A) If:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nSchedule 4  Other amendments of the Privacy Act 1988\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\n\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n(a) an application is made under subsection (1); and\n\n(b) the Commissioner is satisfied that the application is frivolous,\nvexatious, misconceived, lacking in substance or not made in\ngood faith;\nthe Commissioner may, in writing, dismiss the application."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-166-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
