      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 205,
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n\n(3) The Commissioner must specify in the determination a period of\nup to 12 months during which the determination is in force (subject\nto subsection 80D(2))."
    },
