      "values:originalText": "Omit “organisation is taken to contravene section 16A”, substitute\n“APP entity is taken to contravene section 15 or 26A”.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nSchedule 4  Other amendments of the Privacy Act 1988\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\n\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15",
      "skos:definition": "Omit “organisation is taken to contravene section 16A”, substitute\n“APP entity is taken to contravene section 15 or 26A”.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nSchedule 4  Other amendments of the Privacy Act 1988\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\n\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15",
