      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.209",
      "values:originalText": "The Federal Court or Federal Magistrates Court may direct that 2\nor more proceedings for civil penalty orders are to be heard\ntogether.",
