      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.211",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(aa) the Privacy Commissioner (within the meaning of the\nAustralian Information Commissioner Act 2010); and",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n\n(aa) the Privacy Commissioner (within the meaning of the\nAustralian Information Commissioner Act 2010); and",
