    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-6-sec-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "5 Privacy codes may be developed etc. during the transition",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-6-sec-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.247",
      "values:originalText": "period\n(1)\nA function or power conferred on the Commissioner or an entity by\nPart IIIB of the Privacy Act, as inserted by Schedule 3 to this Act, may\nbe performed or exercised during the transition period as if the Privacy\nAct, as amended by this Act, was in force during that period.\n(2)\nThe performance of such a function, or the exercise of such a power,\nduring the transition period has effect, after the commencement time, as\nif it had been performed or exercised under Part IIIB of the Privacy Act\nas inserted by Schedule 3 to this Act.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nSchedule 6  Application, transitional and savings provisions",
      "skos:definition": "period\n(1)\nA function or power conferred on the Commissioner or an entity by\nPart IIIB of the Privacy Act, as inserted by Schedule 3 to this Act, may\nbe performed or exercised during the transition period as if the Privacy\nAct, as amended by this Act, was in force during that period.\n(2)\nThe performance of such a function, or the exercise of such a power,\nduring the transition period has effect, after the commencement time, as\nif it had been performed or exercised under Part IIIB of the Privacy Act\nas inserted by Schedule 3 to this Act.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nSchedule 6  Application, transitional and savings provisions",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-6-sec-5-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "474f12191a0fc99edb1e409fcf646e979c4e414b07cdff12908aa6d10fd5e990",
      "skos:note": "Function or power may be performed or exercised during the transition period as if the Privacy Act was in force."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-6-sec-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "5 Privacy codes may be developed etc. during the transition",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 247,
      "values:originalText": "period\n(1)\nA function or power conferred on the Commissioner or an entity by\nPart IIIB of the Privacy Act, as inserted by Schedule 3 to this Act, may\nbe performed or exercised during the transition period as if the Privacy\nAct, as amended by this Act, was in force during that period.\n(2)\nThe performance of such a function, or the exercise of such a power,\nduring the transition period has effect, after the commencement time, as\nif it had been performed or exercised under Part IIIB of the Privacy Act\nas inserted by Schedule 3 to this Act.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nSchedule 6  Application, transitional and savings provisions"
    },
