    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-6-sec-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "8 Saving—guidelines prepared and published under the",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-6-sec-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.248",
      "values:originalText": "Privacy Act\n(1)\nThis item applies to guidelines if:\n\n(a) the guidelines were prepared and published under paragraph\n27(1)(e) or 28A(1)(e) of the Privacy Act; and\n\n(b) the guidelines were in force immediately before the\ncommencement time.\n(2)\nThe guidelines have effect, after that time, as if they had been made\nunder paragraph 28(1)(a) of that Act, as inserted by Schedule 4 to this\nAct.",
      "skos:definition": "Privacy Act\n(1)\nThis item applies to guidelines if:\n\n(a) the guidelines were prepared and published under paragraph\n27(1)(e) or 28A(1)(e) of the Privacy Act; and\n\n(b) the guidelines were in force immediately before the\ncommencement time.\n(2)\nThe guidelines have effect, after that time, as if they had been made\nunder paragraph 28(1)(a) of that Act, as inserted by Schedule 4 to this\nAct.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-6-sec-8-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5fe75349308a4b74389141122fc0a8bdb857127a9576c35f65499ac747acd217",
      "skos:note": "Guidelines prepared under Privacy Act have effect after commencement time."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-6-sec-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "8 Saving—guidelines prepared and published under the",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 248,
      "values:originalText": "Privacy Act\n(1)\nThis item applies to guidelines if:\n\n(a) the guidelines were prepared and published under paragraph\n27(1)(e) or 28A(1)(e) of the Privacy Act; and\n\n(b) the guidelines were in force immediately before the\ncommencement time.\n(2)\nThe guidelines have effect, after that time, as if they had been made\nunder paragraph 28(1)(a) of that Act, as inserted by Schedule 4 to this\nAct."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-6-sec-8-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-6-sec-8"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-6-sec-9",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "9 Audits by the Commissioner",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-6-sec-9"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.248",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThis item applies if:\n\n(a) before the commencement time, the Commissioner was\nconducting an audit under paragraph 27(1)(h) or (ha),\n28(1)(e) or 28A(1)(g) of the Privacy Act; and\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nApplication, transitional and savings provisions  Schedule 6\nProvisions relating to Schedule 4 to this Act  Part 5\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n(b) immediately before that time, the audit has not been\ncompleted.\n(2)\nDespite the amendments of the Privacy Act made by this Act, the\nCommissioner may continue, after the commencement time, to conduct\nthe audit as if those amendments had not been made.",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nThis item applies if:\n\n(a) before the commencement time, the Commissioner was\nconducting an audit under paragraph 27(1)(h) or (ha),\n28(1)(e) or 28A(1)(g) of the Privacy Act; and\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nApplication, transitional and savings provisions  Schedule 6\nProvisions relating to Schedule 4 to this Act  Part 5\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n(b) immediately before that time, the audit has not been\ncompleted.\n(2)\nDespite the amendments of the Privacy Act made by this Act, the\nCommissioner may continue, after the commencement time, to conduct\nthe audit as if those amendments had not been made.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-6-sec-9-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-6-sec-9-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "283d114a2e137fb93c641a17922dc42bd56c0e3df7b8d624b4e819d51bf04196",
      "skos:note": "The Commissioner may continue an audit after the commencement time."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-6-sec-9",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "9 Audits by the Commissioner",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 248,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThis item applies if:\n\n(a) before the commencement time, the Commissioner was\nconducting an audit under paragraph 27(1)(h) or (ha),\n28(1)(e) or 28A(1)(g) of the Privacy Act; and\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053\n\nApplication, transitional and savings provisions  Schedule 6\nProvisions relating to Schedule 4 to this Act  Part 5\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012\nCompilation date: 12/3/14\nRegistered: 6/3/15\n\n(b) immediately before that time, the audit has not been\ncompleted.\n(2)\nDespite the amendments of the Privacy Act made by this Act, the\nCommissioner may continue, after the commencement time, to conduct\nthe audit as if those amendments had not been made."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-6-sec-9-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
