      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 250,
      "values:originalText": "Subsection 73(1A) of the Privacy Act, as inserted by Schedule 4 to this\nAct, applies in relation to an application made under subsection 73(1) of\nthe Privacy Act after the commencement time."
    },
