    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-6-sec-16-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "16 Pre-commencement complaints",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-6-sec-16-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.252",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThis item applies if:\n\n(a) before the commencement time, a complaint about an act or\npractice was made to the Commissioner under section 36 of\nthe Privacy Act; and\n\n(b) immediately before that time, the Commissioner has not:\n\n(i) decided under Part V of that Act not to investigate, or\nnot to investigate further, the act or practice; or\n\n(ii) made a determination under section 52 of that Act in\nrelation to the complaint.\n(2)\nDespite the amendments of the Privacy Act made by this Act, the\ncomplaint may be dealt with under the Privacy Act after the\ncommencement time as if those amendments had not been made.",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nThis item applies if:\n\n(a) before the commencement time, a complaint about an act or\npractice was made to the Commissioner under section 36 of\nthe Privacy Act; and\n\n(b) immediately before that time, the Commissioner has not:\n\n(i) decided under Part V of that Act not to investigate, or\nnot to investigate further, the act or practice; or\n\n(ii) made a determination under section 52 of that Act in\nrelation to the complaint.\n(2)\nDespite the amendments of the Privacy Act made by this Act, the\ncomplaint may be dealt with under the Privacy Act after the\ncommencement time as if those amendments had not been made.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-6-sec-16-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-6-sec-16-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-6-sec-16-2-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9db5fc76778325ad60aa11c4b2fc24d8c74258b54f07ab090cbd4dfe16325749",
      "skos:note": "Complaints about acts or practices made before commencement time can be dealt with under the Privacy Act after commencement."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012#sch-6-sec-16-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "16 Pre-commencement complaints",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 252,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThis item applies if:\n\n(a) before the commencement time, a complaint about an act or\npractice was made to the Commissioner under section 36 of\nthe Privacy Act; and\n\n(b) immediately before that time, the Commissioner has not:\n\n(i) decided under Part V of that Act not to investigate, or\nnot to investigate further, the act or practice; or\n\n(ii) made a determination under section 52 of that Act in\nrelation to the complaint.\n(2)\nDespite the amendments of the Privacy Act made by this Act, the\ncomplaint may be dealt with under the Privacy Act after the\ncommencement time as if those amendments had not been made."
    },
    {
